<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="MRK" style="id">MLK</book>
  <para style="h">Malako</para>
  <para style="toc1">Tsaangu Yimbwe ya Malako</para>
  <para style="toc2">Malako</para>
  <para style="toc3">Mlk</para>
  <para style="mt2">Tsaangu Yimbwe ya</para>
  <para style="mt1">Malako</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wu Mubwe wa Malako, baasonehele nde huli Bamukristo ba baavele boosi Bayudaayo, bakima aba Bangoyi. Nde ni Musamu wu Mubwe wu afulala bukusi. Mu nde, a baasonehe bukenyi bwa Yisu ve. A bali mu umono muuna kaka bileedi bya Yisu bibila ve. Ka ndulu, nde li mu umweese bileedi bi bilahi bi mapfuutini, bya mbelusi na bya tsobisini minywa. Mu matangu makima, nde li mu usaangula misamu mi myavele mu mihanda mikima mya mu Musamu wu Mubwe.</para>
  <para style="ip">Musamu wu Mubwe wa Malako, li mu uduukala mulahi a nzila wu mihanda mimitatu myatsomi mi Musamu wu Mubwe. Ka tsangu a nde yaavolo ifwaani hya dyambu li linene. Ubaandiha mu bisono bi mulongo a tsomi, Malako li mu umweese Yisu we Mwana a Nzambi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:1">1.1</ref></char>). Hu pedu a tsukusu Musamu wu Mubwe wa Malako, Mwana a Nzambi ukwa, baakomene ŋa kuruwa (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 15:39">15.39</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Mu ibadi hyatsomi hi libuuku mo liniili (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 1:1-8:26">1.1–8.26</ref></char>), Yisu a hali mu utondo ve ti baatu badihula nde mu mawasa. Nde li mu ubeeloso babeedu, nde li mu ubinga mavupu ma mabi, nde li mu utoyo na ibahala hyoosi. Baatu bali mu ufuulasana: «Muutu mo wunuwu na ali?» Ka Yisu li mu uleele huli ba baatsikaha nde: «A lileele huli pasi muutu, me na ndi.»</para>
  <para style="ip">Ibadi hya byole hi libuuku mo liniili (<char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 8:27">8.27</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 16:20">16.20</ref></char>), hili mu umweese buni buutsikaha ti Yisu Mwana a Nzambi ali.</para>
  <para style="ip">Basambili ba musyenge a Looma, baakanyungala baatu ba baakamonehele we mwa banzambi. Baatu mo baniiba, baakasa bipadi bya kimuhili. Baakava bo mifwende na bo baakabiingala mapasi moosi.</para>
  <para style="ip">Kaahu, Yisu Mwana a Nzambi ali, mu usiinga uyamonehele nde woosi muutu, na usiingala Nzambi. Maana ni ma muubita nde hu munyongi na huukwa. Tso bayihi ba Yisu a baaleenge atsikaha mo ve. Bo bali mu utimba Yisu, mu taangu yi bali mu utsundasa nde mu lipfu. Mu umono ŋa Yisu ali mu ukwa, mukuutu balwani ba Looma li mu uleele ti: «Mu mbuli, muutu mo wunuwu beedi Mwana a Nzambi!»</para>
  <para style="ip">Ŋa Yisu ali mu utoyo mu nde mwakulu, nde li mu uteleme we Mwana a Muutu. Ikuma mo hinihi, hili mu umweese nde wuuna wu Nzambi ali mu uva matwala moosi, tso matwala ma utsundasa na ma usa kolo-kolo. Mbindulili a hyo kaka ni ti Yisu beedi mbuli muutu. Ikuma hya «Mwana a Muutu», hili mu umweese tswehi yi yaadiinga bumuutu na isalu hya nde. Musamu wu Mubwe wa Malako, li mu uva hyuhu mo hiniihi: «Yisu ni na?» A hu li na tso muutu wu utwala ufutala mvutu mu mawasa ve. Libuuku la Malako, lili mu umweese nzila yi Yisu haduukili. Lo lili mu ukumbasa mu utsikaha hoole-hoole, Yisu na ali.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="MRK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Yowani Mutondihi mu kumu a Nzala</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:1-12">Mty 3.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:1-18">Luk 3.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:19-28">Yow 1.19-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 1:1" />Mbandihili a Musamu wu Mubwe wa Yisu Kristo, Mwana a Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 1:2" />We bu baasonehe mu muhanda wu mumbihuli Esaya:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">«Mono, me miitsindaha iluumbi hya me hu busu bwa we,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:2">mu uvangimasa nzila a we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.2 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:10">Mty 11.10</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 7:27">Luk 7.27</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 1:3" />Ni ndaha a nde wuuna wu li mu uta ibila mu kumu a nzala:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">“Vangimasaani nzila a Pfumu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 1:3">suungahaani misoho mya nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3">Esa 40.3</ref>; <ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:3">Mty 3.3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:4">Luk 3.4</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:23">Yow 1.23</ref> </char></note>!”»<verse eid="MRK 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 1:4" />Yowani Mutondihi apali mu kumu a nzala. Nde akata ibila: «Sobwaani mbiili, yakaani tondihili mana Nzambi anyahula masumu ma benu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:1">Mty 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:3">Luk 3.3</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:23">Yow 1.23</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 1:5" />Bisu tsi a Yuda yoosi na baatu boosi ba musyenge a Yeruselemi, baakayene huli nde. Bo baakasiinga masumu ma bo ŋa kuungi la baatu. Na Yowani akatondehe bo, mu nzali a Yolodani<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:5">Mty 3.5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:7">Luk 3.7</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 1:6" />Yowani aba alwata ikutu hi baatuunga mu myoso mya buuru nga irunga. Na mu luungu la nde, aba ahada mudi wu mukobo ibulu. Nde akabaadya makooko na maadi ma nyuhi a tsyehe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 1:8">2Pf 1.8</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:4">Mty 3.4</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 11:22">Lev 11.22</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 1:7" />Nde akayabisa bunuubu: «Huuba na muutu wu uya hu mbisa a me, wu afulala me matwala. Me a handi wu akuha mu ubaandama na unyangula mikudu mi bikoodi bya nde ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:11">Mty 3.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:16">Luk 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:27">Yow 1.27</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 1:8" />Me, me miitondehe benu mu mamba, ka nde, nde sa atondehe benu mu Livupu la Ngidi.»<verse eid="MRK 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tondihili a Yisu na ndobisili a nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 3:13">Mty 3.13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:11">4.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21-22">Luk 3.21-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">4.1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 1:9" />Mu taangu mo yiina, Yisu amati hu musyenge a Nazareti mu itaanzi hya Ngalili, na Yowani atondihi nde mu nzali a Yolodani. <verse eid="MRK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 1:10" />Bu Yisu haapali mu nzali, masulubete, nde amoni mayulu maadibumi. Na Livupu laakulimini ŋa yulu a nde we libembe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 3:16">Mty 3.16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:21">Luk 3.21</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:32">Yow 1.32</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 1:11" />Ndaha mosi yaayuhini hu mayulu: «We ni Mwana a me wu litondo. Mu we me ndi mu umono kinya a me yoosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 2:7">Mkg 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 42:1">Esa 42.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 3:17">Mty 3.17</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 17:5">17.5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 7">Mkg 7</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:22">Luk 3.22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:35">9.35</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:13">Kol 1.13</ref>; <ref loc="2PE 1:17">2Pe 1.17</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:1-11">Mty 4.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1-13">Luk 4.1-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 1:12" />Masulubete, Livupu la Nzambi laabiti Yisu hu kumu a nzala<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:1">Mty 4.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:1">Luk 4.1</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 1:13" />Huuna, nde avyosi maku mana ma bilumbu, na Saatana alobisi nde. Bibulu bya bwadi byaba itwadi na Yisu, na bapofi baakakumbasa nde.<verse eid="MRK 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu li mu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:12-17">Mty 4.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14-15">Luk 4.14-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 1:14" />Humbisa a hu baakotisi Yowani mu kondaayi, Yisu ayeni hu Ngalili. Nde akayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe wa Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:12">Mty 4.12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:14">Luk 4.14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:43">Yow 4.43</ref> </char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 1:15" />na nde akaleele: «Tangu yimiito, na Ipfumu hya Nzambi hyaka bebele. Sobwaani mbiili a benu, na saani imiinu mu Musamu wu Mubwe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 56:1">Esa 56.1</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 47:10">Ezk 47.10</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisu miiteele balobi bana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:18-22">Mty 4.18-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:1-11">Luk 5.1-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 1:16" />Bu Yisu hakataangila muvanga a dyanga li musyenge a Ngalili, nde amoni Simoni na Andele mwana a ngu a Simoni. Bo baakabwaha malihi ma bo mu dyanga, mu tooni ati, bo aba balobi. <verse eid="MRK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 1:17" />Buuna, Yisu aleeli bo: «Duukalaani me, me ukitusa benu balobi ba baatu.» <verse eid="MRK 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 1:18" />Masulubete, bo baatiimbi malihi ma bo, na baaduukili Yisu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:11">Luk 5.11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:28">18.28</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 1:19" />Bu Yisu haasusihi mwana a lala, nde amoni Yaki, mwana a Zebedayi na Yowani, mwana a ngu a nde. Bo baabeedi kaka mu bootehe, mu ubaaloondo malihi ma bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:21">Mty 4.21</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 1:20" />Masulubete, Yisu ateeli bo. Bo baasiisi taata a bo Zebedayi na basalili ba nde mutso a bootehe, na bo baaduukili Yisu.<verse eid="MRK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso muutu nga livupu lilibi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:31-37">Luk 4.31-37</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 1:21" />Yisu na bayihi ba nde baayeni hu musyenge a Kapernahumi. Masulubete, mu ilumbu hya saba, bo baakoti mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo na Yisu abaandihi ulongese.<verse eid="MRK 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 1:22" />Baatu ba baakayuha nde, baasinzikimuha mu ndongisili a nde. Mu tooni ati, nde akalongese na matwala. Ndongisili a nde yaaba yaasobohono na yi milongisi mi Mikele<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 7:28">Mty 7.28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:33">Luk 4.33</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 1:23" />Kaahu masulubete, mutso a nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, hwaba na muutu mumosi wu livupu lilibi laakakwamisa. Nde akafulaha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:33">Luk 4.33</ref> </char></note>: <verse eid="MRK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 1:24" />«Yisu musi Nazareti, lo lima na bisu? We yidi mu ubungasana bisu? Me nzaabi na we li: we li wa Ngidi, wu Nzambi amiitsindaha!» <verse eid="MRK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 1:25" />Yisu afwengili livupu lilibi bunuubu: «Ba swii, na pala mu muutu mo wunuwu!» <verse eid="MRK 1:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 1:26" />Livupu lilibi laapali mu muutu, laapfwikisi nde mu mifudi na lo laafulihi mubabu wu munene. <verse eid="MRK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 1:27" />Baatu boosi baakimuhi; na baakafuulasana ŋa hati la bo: «Liniili kaka ki dyambu? Yiniiyi ndongisili yi nyatihi, mu ulongese na matwala! Muutu mo wunuwu li mu utuma napa mavupu ma mabi, na mo kaka mali mu usiingala nde!» <verse eid="MRK 1:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 1:28" />Masulubete, lidumu la nde laatsamuhi pasi tsyelo mu itaanzi hya Ngalili hyoosi.<verse eid="MRK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisu miibeeloso buko bwa Simoni bu mukaasu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:14-17">Mty 8.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38-41">Luk 4.38-41</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 1:29" />Bo bapala mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, masulubete Yisu ayeni hu nzo a Simoni na Andele, itwadi na Yaki na Yowani<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 8:14">Mty 8.14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:38">Luk 4.38</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 1:30" />Buko bwa Simoni bu mukaasu aba abwamina ŋa taangi, bu haaba na baahu. Na masulubete, baatoosili musamu bubeedu huli Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 1:31" />Yisu asusihi huli mubeedu, akaangi nde mu kaka, na atelimisi nde. Baahu laapali mu nde, na buko bwa Simoni akabili bo byudya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:23-25">Mty 4.23-25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 8:16-17">8.16-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:40-44">Luk 4.40-44</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 1:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 1:32" />Bu tsitsaha yaatoodi, hu nyangu hadyami, baatu baabehili Yisu babeedu boosi, na baatu ba matengo maakakwamisa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 4:24">Mty 4.24</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 1:33" />Baatu boosi ba musyenge, baayakuukama ŋa busu bu munywa a nzo. <verse eid="MRK 1:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 1:34" />Nde abeelusi babeedu ba balahi, ba mabeedu ma pila mu pila maakakwamisa. Na nde abingi kaka matengo ma malahi. Yisu a hakava matengo muswa wu uyambila ve, mu tooni ati, mo maaba maayaaba na nde ali.<verse eid="MRK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisu li mu uyabisa Musamu wu Mubwe hu itaanzi hya Ngalili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 4:42-44">Luk 4.42-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 1:35" />Ilumbu hi hyaduukili, tsuumba a ngwali, Yisu asuuhi na apali mu nzo mu uyene nde siha hu kumu a nzala, na huuna, nde akoti mu lisambulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.35 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:12">Luk 4.12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 14:23">Mty 14.23</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 1:36" />Simoni na bambaahi ba baaba na nde, baayeni hu uyasaha Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 1:37" />Bu baasooli nde, bo baaleeli nde: «Baatu boosi bali mu usaha we.» <verse eid="MRK 1:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 1:38" />Nde afutili bo: «Tswendaani tsyelo kima, mu mala ma ibiingi mo hinihi. Mana huuna kaka, me nzabisa Musamu wu Mubwe. Mu tooni ati, ni mu nde me anziila<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:43">Luk 4.43</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 61:1">Esa 61.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:18">Luk 4.18</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 1:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 1:39" />Na nde ataangili itaanzi hya Ngalili hyoosi, mu ubaalongese mutso manzo ma lisambulu ma Bayudaayo na ubaabinga matengo.<verse eid="MRK 1:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso nga bwatsi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:1-4">Mty 8.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:12-16">Luk 5.12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 1:40" />Muutu mumosi nga bwatsi miiya huli Yisu, atsokomo, nde ayayiini Yisu: «Tso we tondi, we utwala utsyemese me!» <verse eid="MRK 1:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 1:41" />Bu hakwili nde lingebe, Yisu alabi hoho, abembi nde na aleeli: «Me tondi buuna, ba wu atsyeme!» <verse eid="MRK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 1:42" />Masulubete, bwatsi bwamati mu nde na nde atsyemi. <verse eid="MRK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 1:43" />Yisu aduti nde matswi, abingi nde mu mawasa, <verse eid="MRK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 1:44" />na aleeli nde: «Kele, a hayabisa lo huli pasi muutu. Ka yene we mwakulu yamonehele huli ngaanga a Nzambi, na yava nde bungodu bu Moose hatuma mu tsyemili a we, mana bwo buba imbangi huli bo, ti we miibeeloho<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1.44 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 13:2">Lev 13.2</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 14:1">14.1</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 1:45" />Ka muutu mo wuuna ayene, abaandihi uyaleele ma malahi na utsala musamu pasi mbuha huli baatu boosi. Ni mu buuna, Yisu hakabwevelekoto mu pasi musyenge ŋa miisu ma baatu. Nde aba ubaatsahala aka mu matsomo ma misyenge, mu hwavele a baatu. Ka baatu baakamata bibiingi byosi, baakaya huli nde.<verse eid="MRK 1:45" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="MRK 2" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso ikata</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:1-8">Mty 9.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:17-26">Luk 5.17-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 2:1" />Humbisa a mwa bilumbu, Yisu abwefutaha hu musyenge a Kapernahumi. Buuna, baatu baayuhi ti nde aka hu nzo. <verse eid="MRK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 2:2" />Baatu ba balahi baayatsonzomo huuna, natee bu mambuha maasiidi tsatu, tso ŋa busu bu munywa a nzo. Na Yisu akalongese bo mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 2:3" />Baatu baayidi huli Yisu, baabehili nde ikata imosi, hi baatu bana baaba baatsyete. <verse eid="MRK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 2:4" />Ka mu tooni a koonge a baatu, bo a baatwali uyamweese Yisu ikata mo ve. Ni mu buuna, bo baavaati na ikata hu yulu a mwanzi, na baatubi vulu mu mwanzi mu masungimini ma Yisu haba. Mu vulu mo liina, bo baakulimisi ikata mu ipoyi hi hyo hyaba hyalambama. <verse eid="MRK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 2:5" />Bu Yisu haamoni imiinu hya bo, nde aleeli huli ikata: «Mwana a me, masumu ma we bamiinyahula.» <verse eid="MRK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 2:6" />Ŋaana hwaba hwatsahala milongisi mi mikele mi myakaleelesene hutso mitima: <verse eid="MRK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 2:7" />«Mu hima Muutu mo wunuwu huutwala uleele buuna? Nde miituha Nzambi. Na li na matwala ma unyahula masumu? Ndulu ni Nzambi siha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 103:3">Mkg 103.3</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 32:5">Mkg 32.5</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 51:3">51.3</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 43:25">Esa 43.25</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24.16</ref> </char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 2:8" />Masulubete, Yisu mu livupu, abaanguli matsimi ma mitima mya bo na aleeli bo: «Mu hima lili mu utsima buuna mutso mitima mya benu? <verse eid="MRK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 2:9" />Hima hyafulala uleenge mu uleele huli ikata: “Masumu ma we bamiinyahula”? Buuve mu uleele: “Teleme, tsyete ipoyi hya we na takula”? <verse eid="MRK 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 2:10" />Eye, ka me tondi ti benu liyaaba ti Mwana a Muutu li na matwala ma unyahula masumu ŋa toto.» Buuna, Yisu aleeli huli ikata: <verse eid="MRK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 2:11" />«Me miindeele we, teleme, tsyete ipoyi hya we na yene hu nzo a we!» <verse eid="MRK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 2:12" />Masulubete, muutu wu aba ikata atelimi, atsyeti ipoyi hya nde na apali ŋa miisu ma baatu boosi. Boosi baakimuhi na baakayusa Nzambi na ubaaleele: «Buuna, bisu kini a laamoni la pila yiniiyi ve!»<verse eid="MRK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiteele Levi na udya na ba baasumaha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:9-13">Mty 9.9-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:27-32">Luk 5.27-32</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 2:13" />Ŋa mbisa a maana, Yisu abwefutaha ŋa muvanga a dyanga la hu itaanzi hya Ngalili. Koonge a baatu yoosi, yaakaya huli nde, na nde akalongese bo. <verse eid="MRK 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 2:14" />Bu Yisu haakavyoho, nde amoni Levi, mwana a Alafe, wu abeedi atsahala mu nzo isalu yi bakaambi ba limandu. Yisu aleeli nde: «Duukala me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 1:43">Yow 1.43</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:9">Mty 9.9</ref> </char></note>!» Levi atelimi na aduukili nde. <verse eid="MRK 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 2:15" />Bu Yisu haaba hatsahala ŋa metse mu udya mu nzo a Levi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 5:29">Luk 5.29</ref></char></note>, bakaambi ba limandu ba balahi na baatu ba baasumaha, baakadya itwadi na nde na bayihi ba nde. Mu tooni ati, baatu ba balahi, baakaduukala nde. <verse eid="MRK 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 2:16" />Milongisi mi mikele mi myaba mu kabu li Bafarisi, myamoni ti Yisu li mu udya na bakaambi ba limandu na ba baasumaha. Buuna, myo myaleeli huli bayihi ba nde: «Mu hima nde ali mu udya na bakaambi ba limandu na ba baasumaha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 15:1-2">Luk 15.1-2</ref> </char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 2:17" />Bu Yisu haayuhi ma bo baaleeli, nde akaali: «Babeedu ni basahi ba ngaanga, a batsiitsa ve. Me a hanzandanda ba bali tsiitsa ve, ka me anzandanda ba bali basumihi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:13">Mty 9.13</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:31">21.31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:32">Luk 5.32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:10">19.10</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 1:15">1Ti 1.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mty 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisu miilongese mu dyambu li ikaandi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:14-17">Mty 9.14-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 5:33-39">Luk 5.33-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 2:18" />Ilumbu imosi, bayihi ba Yowani na Bafarisi baakadya ikaandi. Baatu baayafuula Yisu: «Bayihi ba Yowani na bayihi ba Bafarisi bali mu udya ikaandi; ka mu hima bayihi ba we baaveledya ikaandi?» <verse eid="MRK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 2:19" />Yisu afutili bo: «Benu litsimi ti byenyi bi mukungi makweele, utwala udya ikaandi bu mukweeli akini ŋa hati la bo? Bu mukweeli akini ŋa hati la bo, bo utwala udya ikaandi ve. <verse eid="MRK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 2:20" />Ka mu bilumbu bi byuya, buumaasa bo mukweeli. Buuna, ilumbu mo hiina, bo buudya ikaandi.<verse eid="MRK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 2:21" />A hu li na muutu wu ubaalondo ikutu hi ikulu mu ireende hya tsanda hi inyatihi ve. Kini, ireende hi inyatihi hyubwekasula tsanda yikulu. Buuna, vulu luubwefulala bunene. <verse eid="MRK 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 2:22" />Ni bumosi kaka, muutu utwala usyeholo malamu ma tsohele mutso mirumbu mi mikulu ve, kini malamu ma tsohele muubula mirumbu. Buuna, na malamu, na mirumbu, byosi byunyambahana. Ka baafwana usyeholo malamu ma tsohele mutso mirumbu mi minyatihi!»<verse eid="MRK 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mwana a Muutu ni Pfumu ilumbu hya saba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:1-8">Mty 12.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:1-5">Luk 6.1-5</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 2:23" />Mu ilumbu hya saba, bu Yisu haakataangila tsyehe masangu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">masaangu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Bisu limiisalila masaangu ŋa mbuha a bele. Bele ni mbutu yi baasonehe mu mabuuku ma Bangeleke, yi bubaavaanga farine yi bali mu uvaanga mapa.</char></note>, bayihi ba nde mu nzila a nzila, baabaandihi ukoolo mivoovo mi masaangu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 23:26">Pfu 23.26</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 2:24" />Buuna, Bafarisi baaleeli huli Yisu: «Mono, mu hima bayihi ba we bali mu uvanga mi baaliha usa mu ilumbu hya saba<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:6">1Sa 21.6</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 34:21">Pal 34.21</ref></char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 2:25" />Yisu afutili bo: «Benu kini a laataangi ma Davidi haavaangi ilumbu imosi, ŋa bo baaba baamiikeehele ve? Mu tooni ati, nde mwakulu na bambaahi ba nde, baaba na nzala. <verse eid="MRK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 2:26" />Nde akoti mu nzo a Nzambi, mu taangu yi Abyatariya haaba mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi. Nde adiidi mapa ma baayeholo huli Nzambi, ma pasi muutu a hali na muswa mu udya mo ve, ka ndulu bangaanga ba Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1SA 21:2-7">1Sa 21.2-7</ref>; <ref loc="2SA 15:35">2Sa 15.35</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 24:9">Lev 24.9</ref></char></note>. Na Davidi aviidi mo kaka huli bambaahi ba nde.» <verse eid="MRK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 2:27" />Na Yisu abweleele bo: «Baavaangi saba mu tooni a baatu, ka a baatu baavaangi mu tooni a saba ve. <verse eid="MRK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 2:28" />Ni mu buuna, Mwana a muutu ali napa Pfumu a saba.»<verse eid="MRK 2:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="MRK 3" />
  <para style="s">Yisu miibeeloso muutu mu ilumbu hya saba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:9-14">Mty 12.9-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:6-11">Luk 6.6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 3:1" />Titswene, Yisu abwefutaha mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. Muuna mwaba na muutu nga kaka li laararama. <verse eid="MRK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 3:2" />Bafarisi baakakete Yisu, mu umono tso nde ubeeloso muutu mu ilumbu hya saba, mana bo bayakese nde. <verse eid="MRK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 3:3" />Na Yisu aleeli huli muutu nga kaka li laararama: «Teleme! Na yaanga ŋa butima.» <verse eid="MRK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 3:4" />Titswene, nde afuuli huli baatu: «Hima baava muswa mu uvaanga mu ilumbu hya saba? Uvaanga libwe, vo uvaanga libi? Ufuuhasa idiingu hya muutu, vo uduba nde?» Ka bo boosi baasiidi swii. <verse eid="MRK 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 3:5" />Buuna, Yisu atali bo na ifwefwe. Ka nde aluuli kaka mu lingebe mu tooni bunono bu mitima mya bo. Nde aleeli huli muutu mo wuuna: «Laba kaka la we.» Nde alabi kaka la nde na lo laabeeluhi. <verse eid="MRK 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 3:6" />Bafarisi baapali mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo na baapfuutini mawasa-mawasa na baatu ba kabu la Eloode, mu pfuundu yi usaha buni bo buuduba Yisu.<verse eid="MRK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso baatu ŋa muvaanga a dyanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 4:25">Mty 4.25</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 12:15-16">12.15-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:17-19">Luk 6.17-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 3:7" />Yisu ayeni na bayihi ba nde hu muvaanga a dyanga la Ngalili. Koonge a baatu yinene yaaduukili nde: Baatu mo baana baamati hu Ngalili na hu Yude, <verse eid="MRK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 3:8" />hu Yeruselemi, hu Idumiya<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.8 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Idumiya </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itaanzi hi hili hu baanda musyenge a Yude.</char></note>, hu toto yi yili hu simu lina la Yolodani bebele na Tiilo, na Sidoni. Baatu mo baana baayidi mu koonge huli Yisu mu tooni ati, bo baayuhi tsangu a mambu ma nde haakavaanga. <verse eid="MRK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 3:9" />Buuna, Yisu aleeli huli bayihi ba nde mu uvangimasa nde hyabu mana koonge a yivinyala nde. <verse eid="MRK 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 3:10" />Mu tooni ati, bu nde haakabeeloso baatu ba balahi, babeedu boosi baakabingalala ubeembe nde. <verse eid="MRK 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 3:11" />Ŋa mavupu ma mabi maakamono Yisu, mo maakabwa ŋa busu bwa nde na maakafulaha: «We, we ni Mwana a Nzambi!» <verse eid="MRK 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 3:12" />Ka Yisu akasinzakebese bo mu mifudi mu uveleleele ti nde Mwana a Nzambi.<verse eid="MRK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Tsoolili a kuumi na biluumbi byole</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:1-4">Mty 10.1-4</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 6:12-16">Luk 6.12-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 3:13" />Ŋa mbisa a maana, Yisu akumisi hu yulu isyelo, nde ateeli ba nde hatondi, na bo baayidi huli nde. <verse eid="MRK 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 3:14" />Nde abyalisi kuumi na boole, ba nde haluhi biluumbi. Nde asooli bo, mu uba itwadi na nde na mu utsindaha bo bayayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe. <verse eid="MRK 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 3:15" />Yisu aviidi bo kaka matwala ma ubinga matengo. <verse eid="MRK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 3:16" />Manduhi ma kuumi na biluumbi byole bi Yisu hasooli ni maniima: Simoni wu Yisu haviidi kuumbu Peetelo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.16 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:16-18">Mty 16.16-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 1:42">Yow 1.42</ref></char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 3:17" />Yaki, mwana a Zebedayi na Yowani mwana a ngu a nde, ba nde haviidi kuumbu Bwanengesi, mbindulili ni ti «mwana a nzyedi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 9:54">Luk 9.54</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 3:18" />Andele, Filipo, Batolomayi, Mataayi, Tomasi, Yaki mwana a Alafe, Tadayi, Simoni Muzeloti<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3.18 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Muzeloti </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbindulili ni ti: Wu atondo tsi a nde, wu ubaalwanila yo (Mty 10.4).</char></note>, <verse eid="MRK 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 3:19" />na Yuda nga kuumbu Isikaryoti, wu ayehuli Yisu.<verse eid="MRK 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu a habaambana na matengo ve</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:22-32">Mty 12.22-32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14-23">Luk 11.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:10">12.10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 3:20" />Titswene, Yisu afutihi hu nzo, na koonge a baatu yabweyakuukama. Nde na bayihi ba nde, a baabwetwala tso ubwedya ve. <verse eid="MRK 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 3:21" />Bu ikuta hya Yisu hyayuhi buuna, hyo hyayeni hu uyavolo nde. Mu tooni ati, bo baakaleele ti: «Nde liniili ka ladi!» <verse eid="MRK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 3:22" />Milongisi mi Mikele mi myamati hu Yeruselemi myakaleele: «Belesebuli<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:25">Mty 10.25</ref></char></note> li mu nde! Ni mu matwala ma pfumu matengo nde ali mu ubinga matengo!» <verse eid="MRK 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 3:23" />Buuna, Yisu ateeli bo, na ayambili na bo mu makuma: «Buni Saatana huutwala ubinga Saatana? <verse eid="MRK 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 3:24" />Tso ipfumu hya tsi hikabuhi na tso baatu ba ipfumu mo hiina bali mu ulwana bomo na bomo, ipfumu mo hiina sa hitsaamuha. <verse eid="MRK 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 3:25" />Na tso baatu ba nzo mosi bali mu ukaakana bomo na bomo, nzo mo yiina utwala ukwilala ve. <verse eid="MRK 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 3:26" />Ni mu buuna, tso Saatana li mu ulwanisa nde mwakulu, na tso nde li wu akabuha, nde utwala ukwilala ve. Yiina ni tsukusu a nde.»<verse eid="MRK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 3:27" />«Muutu tso mumosi utwala ukoto mu nzo a nga pinyu na utaana bya nde ve, hwavele umaahada nde mikudu. Ka tso nde teehili uhada muutu nga pinyu mikudu, buuna nde utwala utaana bya mu nzo a nde byosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 12:19">Mty 12.19</ref>; <ref loc="COL 2:15">Kol 2.15</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 3:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 3:28" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, Nzambi unyahula masumu ma baatu boosi, naapa bituhi bi bali mu utuha nde, tso byafulala bulahi. <verse eid="MRK 3:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 3:29" />Ka pasi nde wu utuha Livupu la Ngidi, a huuyaka nyahulili lisumu mo liina ve: Nde li mu ubita tooni a lo mu bilima na bilima.»<verse eid="MRK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 3:30" />Yisu ali mu uleele buuna, mu tooni a bu bo baaleeli ti: «Nde na livupu lilibi!»<verse eid="MRK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ikuta hya mbuli hya Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 12:46-50">Mty 12.46-50</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:19-21">Luk 8.19-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 3:31" />Ngu na baana ba ngu a Yisu baayidi. Bu baaba baateleme ŋa mbadi, baatsindihi muutu mu uyateele Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 3:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 3:32" />Koonge a baatu yi yaaba yadiinga Yisu maatsahala, yaaleeli nde: «Mono, ngu a we na baana ba ngu a we hu mbadi bali, bo bali mu usaha we.» <verse eid="MRK 3:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 3:33" />Yisu akaali: «Ngu a me ni na? Na baana ba ngu a me ni ba na?» <verse eid="MRK 3:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 3:34" />Titswene bu nde hatali baatu ba baaba baadiinga nde maatsahala, nde aleeli: «Monwaani ngu a me, na baana ba ngu a me! <verse eid="MRK 3:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 3:35" />Mu tooni ati, woosi wu li mu ukuhasa litondo la Nzambi, wuuna ni mwana a ngu a me, wuuna ni kedi a me, na wuuna ni ngu a me.»<verse eid="MRK 3:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="MRK 4" />
  <para style="s">Kuma a mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:1-9">Mty 13.1-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:4-8">Luk 8.4-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 4:1" />Yisu abwebaandiha ulongese ŋa muvanga a dyanga la Ngalili. Koonge yinene yaayadiinga nde. Ni mu buuna, nde haakoti na haatsahili mutso a hyabu ŋa yulu a dyanga. Na koonge yoosi yaaba ŋa simu la dyanga. <verse eid="MRK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 4:2" />Yisu akalongese bo misamu mi milahi mu makuma. Na mu ndongisili a nde, nde akaleele bo: <verse eid="MRK 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 4:3" />«Yuhaani! Ilumbu imosi, mukuni apali mu unyanza muhunu. <verse eid="MRK 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 4:4" />Bu nde haakanyanza mbutu, mbutu yina yaabwiidi mu muvaanga musoho, banyunyi baayidi na baadiidi yo. <verse eid="MRK 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 4:5" />Mbutu kima yaabwiidi ŋa yulu a toto mamanya, hu hwavele na toto yindahi. Mbutu yaameni mawasa, mu tooni ati, toto a yaaba yindahi ve. <verse eid="MRK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 4:6" />Bu nyangu haabeengi, nde anyengisi mitswihala, na myo myakanyi mu tooni avele li manganzi. <verse eid="MRK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 4:7" />Mbutu kima yaabwiidi ŋatso bangamba. Bangamba baabuuhi na baavinyili mitswihala. Na myo, a myaabuti mbutu ve. <verse eid="MRK 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 4:8" />Ka mbutu kima yaabwiidi ŋa toto a mbolese. Mitswiihala myaabuuhi, myarandi na myaapalisi bisaka. Isaka imosi hyaaviidi mbutu maku matatu (30), hina hyaaviidi mbutu maku masamunu (60), na bina kama (100) la mbutu.» <verse eid="MRK 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 4:9" />Na Yisu aleeli: «Muutu nga matswi mu uyuha, nyaha ayuha!»<verse eid="MRK 4:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisu mu hima ubaasalila makuma</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:10-17">Mty 13.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:9-10">Luk 8.9-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 4:10" />Bu Yisu haatahuhi lala na koonge a baatu, ba baaba baadiinga nde na biluumbi bikuumi na byole, baafuuli nde mu dyambu li makuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 4:11" />Nde akaali bo: «Tswehi a Ipfumu hya Nzambi, baamiiva huli benu. Ka huli baatu ba bali hu mbadi, bo ubaayuha yo mu makuma. <verse eid="MRK 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 4:12" />Ni mu buuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">“bo bali mu usungamana, ka a bali mu umono ve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Bo bali mu uyuha, ka a bali mu utsikaha ve.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">Tso bo buutsikaha, bo buusobo mbiili,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 4:12">na Nzambi usa bo kolo-kolo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9-10">Esa 6.9-10</ref> </char></note>!”»<verse eid="MRK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mbindulili a kuma mukuni</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:18-23">Mty 13.18-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:11-15">Luk 8.11-15</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 4:13" />Titswene Yisu abweleele bo: Tso benu a lili mu utsikaha kuma mo yiniiyi ve, buni benu luutsikaha makuma mana moosi? <verse eid="MRK 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 4:14" />Mukuni ni muutu wu ubaakuna maambu. <verse eid="MRK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 4:15" />Ba bali mu muvaanga a musoho, ni baatu ba bubaayuha maambu, ka Saatana ubaaya mawasa na umaasa ma baakuni mu mitima mya bo. <verse eid="MRK 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 4:16" />Mbutu kima yi yaabwiidi ŋa toto yi mamanya, ni baatu bakima ba bubaayaka maambu: masulubete ma bamiiyuha mo, bo bali mu uyaka mo na kinya. <verse eid="MRK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 4:17" />Ka mambu a mu baamenese bo manganzi mu bo mwakulu ve, bo bubaakangama mu mo ndulu mu mwana a taangu hoole. Titswene, tso babwani na mbingisili, buuve tso batsundisi bo mu tooni a mambu ma Nzambi, masulubete bo buutiimba imiinu hya bo. <verse eid="MRK 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 4:18" />Mbutu kima yi yaabwiidi ŋa toto matsyende, ni baatu ba bali mu uyuha mambu, <verse eid="MRK 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 4:19" />ka bo bali mu usinzatsima manzala ma tsi, soho li busina na mapeyu ma pila mu pila, ni biina bibaavinyala mambu ma Nzambi, na mo a mali mu ubuta mbutu ve. <verse eid="MRK 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 4:20" />Mbutu kima yi yaabwiidi ŋa toto ya mbolese, ni baatu ba bali mu uyaka mambu na bali mu ubuta mbutu, mumosi maku matatu (30), mukima maku masamunu (60), na mukima kama (100).<verse eid="MRK 4:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuma a mwinda na ya hyetso</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 8:16-18">Luk 8.16-18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 4:21" />Nde abweleele bo: «Muutu ubehe mwinda, mu usuusa nde hutso ipaanyi buuve hu tsina a taangi? Mwinda ubaasuusa a ni ŋa hwasyenoho ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:15">Mty 5.15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:33">Luk 11.33</ref></char></note>? <verse eid="MRK 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 4:22" />Byosi bi byasweme, byumonehele ŋa liyalala. Na mambu moosi ma tswehi, muuyabahana ŋa liyalala. <verse eid="MRK 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 4:23" />Muutu wu li na matswi mu uyuha, nyaha ayuha!» <verse eid="MRK 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 4:24" />Yisu abweleele bo: «Kebaani mu ma benu lili mu uyuha! Hyetso hi benu libaasalila mu uyelemese bana, ni hiina kaka Nzambi huusalila mu uyelemese benu. Na nde ubwebwese ikima hi hyasinzafulala. <verse eid="MRK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 4:25" />Ni mu buuna, muutu wu li na isiha, buubweva nde bi byafulala. Ka huli wu avele na isiha, buumaasa nde tso hi nde ali na hyo.»<verse eid="MRK 4:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kuma yi muhunu wu akuli mu nde mwakulu.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 4:26" />Yisu abweleele: «Mbindulili a Ipfumu hya Nzambi ni yiniiyi: Muutu mumosi li mu unyanza muhunu mutso a ngundu a nde. <verse eid="MRK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 4:27" />Butsuhu na nyangu, tso nde bwaamini tso nde suuhi, muhunu li muupaanduha na li mu umene, hwavele muutu utsikaha buni libaavangama. <verse eid="MRK 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 4:28" />Toto yo mwakulu yibaabuuhasa: ubaandiha mu muti, titswene mivoovo, natee mbutu yi yaakomo mu mivoovo. <verse eid="MRK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 4:29" />Na bu mbutu yim iiyele, mawasa-mawasa bubaatsindaha bakooli na mambeedi ma ngololo mu tooni ati, taangu yi utsonzehe mbutu yimiito<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 4:13">Yow 4.13</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 4:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kuma libutu la mutade</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:31-32">Mty 13.31-32</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 13:34">34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 13:18-19">Luk 13.18-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 4:30" />Yisu akabweleele: «Na hima luutwala ufwanisa Ipfumu hya Nzambi? Mu ki kuma bisu luutwala umweese hyo? <verse eid="MRK 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 4:31" />Ipfumu hya Nzambi hyafwanina na libutu la mutade, bu bamiikuna lo mu toto, lo lili libutu li laalutahala bukeehe mu mbutu yoosi ŋa tsi. <verse eid="MRK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 4:32" />Ka hu mbisa ukuna libutu, lo libaakula, libaalutahala mu bunene byosi bi baakuna mu wooto. Lo libaalaabisa bitabi bi binene bi banyunyi ba yulu bubaatunga byanza bya bo hu tsina a posi a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 4:9">Dan 4.9</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 17:23">Ezk 17.23</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 31:6">31.6</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 4:33" />Yisu akava ndongisili a nde mu makuma ma malahi ma pila mo yiniiyi, mu iteesi hiba baakayuha baakitwala utsikaha. <verse eid="MRK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 4:34" />Yisu a haakatoyo na koonge, hwavele usalila kuma ve. Ka ŋa tswehi, nde akabindula moosi huli bayihi ba nde.<verse eid="MRK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miivudamasa ifula hiinene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:23-27">Mty 8.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:22-25">Luk 8.22-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 4:35" />Ilumbu mo hiina ŋa tsitsaha, Yisu aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: «Lisabuhaani hu simu lina la dyanga.» <verse eid="MRK 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 4:36" />Bayihi baasiisi koonge a baatu, na bo baabiti Yisu mu hyabu hi nde haaba ŋa yulu a hyo. Hwaba kaka na byabu bikima, bi byakayene na nde. <verse eid="MRK 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 4:37" />Masulubete, ifula imosi hi mifudi hyanyingisi, na mapo maakabwa hutso a hyabu, na hyo hyabaandihi uluula mamba. <verse eid="MRK 4:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 4:38" />Na Yisu aba tolo hu mbisa a hyabu, asika mutswe ŋa yulu a kurusu<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4.38 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">kurusu </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isiha hi ibaasyenolo mutswe ŋa taangi, mu taangu yi ubwamina.</char></note>. Bayihi baasuuli nde na baaleeli: «Mulongisi, bisu limiikwa! Na a hili mu umweese we pasi ve?» <verse eid="MRK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 4:39" />Yisu asuuha, afwengili ifula mu mifudi na aleeli huli dyanga: «Ba swii! Vudamana!» Buuna ifula hyavuumi na kele yaafwiidi. <verse eid="MRK 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 4:40" />Titswene nde aleeli huli bayihi: «Mu hima benu lili na boomo? Benu kini imiinu ve?» <verse eid="MRK 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 4:41" />Ka boomo bu bwafulala bwakaangi bayihi na baakalelesene: «Nde wunuwu na ali, wu a tso ifula na mapo ma dyanga bibaasiingala nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 65:8">Mkg 65.8</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 89:10">89.10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 107:23-32">107.23-32</ref></char></note>?»<verse eid="MRK 4:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="MRK 5" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso nga livupu lilibi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 8:28-34">Mty 8.28-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:26-39">Luk 8.26-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 5:1" />Yisu na bayihi ba nde, baayato hu simu lina la dyanga, hu tsi a bisu Ngelaseneya. <verse eid="MRK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 5:2" />Yisu asutaha mu hyabu, <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.1-2 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Tsi a Ngelaseneya ni itaanzi hi hili hu Esete a dyanga li musyenge a Ngalili.</char></note>masulubete, muutu mumosi apali hutso mangila, nde aba na livupu lilibi, na nde ayabwana Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 5:3" />Muutu mo aba ubaatsahala hutso mangila, na muutu tso mumosi a haakabwetwala uhada nde tso mu paanga ve. <verse eid="MRK 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 5:4" />Mataangu makima, baakahada nde myoho na miilu mu bitali na mapaanga. Ka nde akatabula byo byosi, na pasi muutu a hakabwekuuta nde ve. <verse eid="MRK 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 5:5" />Taangu yoosi, butsuhu na nyangu, nde akabaadyengele hutso mangila na hu yulu bisyelo, mu ubaafulaha na ubaanemese linyutu mu mamanya. <verse eid="MRK 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 5:6" />Bu nde haatalili Yisu hu lala, nde ayeni tiinu mu uyakongemene ŋa busu bwa nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 5:7" />Nde afulihi mu ndaha yi mifudi: «Yisu, Mwana a Nzambi wa hu hati a yulu, we na me ki dyambu? Kolo-kolo a we, mu nduhi a Nzambi, a hanyongese me!» <verse eid="MRK 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 5:8" />Mu tooni ati, Yisu akaleele nde: «Livupu lilibi, pala mu muutu mo wunuuwu!» <verse eid="MRK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 5:9" />Na Yisu afuuli nde: «Nduhi a we na?» Nde afutili: «Nduhi a me “Koonge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Koonge </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Litaangu li masadaadu la bebele na biveeve bisamunu huli bisu Looma.</char></note>”, mu tooni ati, bisu lili ba balahi.» <verse eid="MRK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 5:10" />Na nde asinziyayaana Yisu, mu uveletsindaha mo hu mbadi a tsi.<verse eid="MRK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 5:11" />Bu ŋaana hwaba na koonge yinene yi bangulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 11:7">Lev 11.7</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 14:8">Pfu 14.8</ref></char></note> yi yaaba mu udya ŋa pedu isyelo, <verse eid="MRK 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 5:12" />mavupu ma mabi maayayiini Yisu, na maaleeli: «Tsindaha bisu hutso bangulu mo baniiba, mana bisu likoto mu bo!» <verse eid="MRK 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 5:13" />Yisu aviidi bo muswa. Buuna mavupu ma mabi maapali, maakoti mu bangulu. Koonge bangulu yi litaangu laaba bebele na biveeve byole (2 000), yaakulimini mu tiinu yoosi hutso a dyanga umata hu yulu mutsundu. Bangulu boosi baadyami. <verse eid="MRK 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 5:14" />Ba baakabuungala bangulu baabati na baayayabisa musamu hutso musyenge na mu mala. Na baatu baayamono ma maavyohi. <verse eid="MRK 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 5:15" />Baatu bayato ŋa pedu a Yisu, baamoni nga koonge mavupu ma mabi atsahala, alwaata na tsiki yoosi. Na bo baamoni boomo. <verse eid="MRK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 5:16" />Ba baamoni ma maavyohi, baayabisi bo buni maabwiili huli nga mavupu ma mabi na huli bangulu. <verse eid="MRK 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 5:17" />Buuna bo baabaandihi uyayaana Yisu mu umata mu itaanzi hya bo. <verse eid="MRK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 5:18" />Bu Yisu haakanama mu hyabu, nde wuuna wu aba na mavupu ma mabi ayayiini Yisu mu uyene na nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 5:19" />Yisu a haaviidi nde muswa ve, ka aleeli nde: «Futaha hu nzo a we, huli ikuta hya we, na yabisa bo moosi ma Pfumu amiivangila we na buni nde amiikwila we lingebe.» <verse eid="MRK 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 5:20" />Muutu mo wuuna ayeni na abaandihi uyabisa mu itaanzi hya Dekapoli<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5.20 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Dekapoli</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itaanzi hi hyaaba hu Sude ya Esete ya dyanga la Ngenesareti.</char></note>, moosi ma Yisu haavangili nde. Na baatu boosi baakimuhi.<verse eid="MRK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso mukaasu na miisuula mwana a Yayiro mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 9:18-26">Mty 9.18-26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:40-56">Luk 8.40-56</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 5:21" />Yisu abwesabuha simu lina mu hyabu, na koonge a baatu yinene yaakuukimi ŋa busu bwa nde. Nde aba ŋa muvanga a dyanga. <verse eid="MRK 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 5:22" />Mumosi mu bakuutu ba nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo, nga nduhi a Yayiro ayidi; amono Yisu, nde abwiidi ŋa miilu mya nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 5:23" />Na asinziyayaana huli nde, na uleele: «Mwana a me wu mukaasu aka ŋa pedu lipfu. Yaanga yaasuusala nde myoho, mana nde afuuha na aba moonyi!» <verse eid="MRK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 5:24" />Yisu ayeni na Yayiro. Koonge a baatu yinene yaakaduukala nde na yaakavinyala nde matsyelo moosi.<verse eid="MRK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 5:25" />Kaahu, mutso a koonge, hwaba na mukaasu mumosi wu makila maakapuuha umata bilima kuumi na byole. <verse eid="MRK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 5:26" />Nde akasinzamono pasi, mu mbuhili babuhi ba balahi. Nde anyambisini busina bwa nde bwosi, hwavele a tsoongo. Ka bubeedu bwa nde bwakatsohemene. <verse eid="MRK 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 5:27" />Mukaasu mo wunuwu ayuha tsangu a Yisu, nde ayidi mu limbimbisa la Yisu na abeembi ikutu hya nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 5:28" />Ka nde akaleele: «Tso me mbeembi ndulu bikutu bya nde, me upfuuha!» <verse eid="MRK 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 5:29" />Masulubete, makila ma maakapuuha nde maakanyi, na nde ayaabi mu linyutu la nde ti nde miibeeloho mu bubeedu bwa nde. <verse eid="MRK 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 5:30" />Masulubete, Yisu ayaabi ti, mifudi mimiipala mu nde. Buuna, nde akinguhi ŋa butima bwa koonge na afuuli: «Na miibeembe bikutu bya me?» <verse eid="MRK 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 5:31" />Bayihi ba nde baafutili: «We li mu umono hwawe ti, koonge yili mu uvinyala we matsyelo moosi, na we bwefuula: “Na miibeembe me?”» <verse eid="MRK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 5:32" />Ka Yisu akatala ibiingi hya nde, mu uyaaba na asiidi buuna. <verse eid="MRK 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 5:33" />Mukaasu atsuli likamba mu boomo, bu nde hamoni ma maavyohi mu nde. Nde ayabwa ŋa miilu mya Yisu na ayabisi nde imbuli hyoosi. <verse eid="MRK 5:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 5:34" />Ka Yisu aleeli nde: «Mwana a me wu mukaasu, imiinu hya we himiifuuhasa we; yene mu hyenze, nyaha we beeloho mu bubeedu bwa we.»<verse eid="MRK 5:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 5:35" />Bu Yisu haaba kini mu uyambila, baatu baamati hu nzo a Yayiro na baaleeli huli nde: «Mwana a we wu mukaasu miikwa; mu hima mu ubwekwamisa Mulongisi?» <verse eid="MRK 5:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 5:36" />Ka Yisu, wu ayakimuha mambu mo maana, aleeli huli mukuutu a nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo: «A ba na boomo ve, sa ndulu imiinu!» <verse eid="MRK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 5:37" />Na Yisu a haasiingisi pasi muutu mu uyakeele nde ve, vengo Peetelo, Yaki na Yowani mwana a ngu a Yaki. <verse eid="MRK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 5:38" />Bo baatoodi huli mukuutu a nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. Huuna Yisu amoni muyunga a koonge a baatu ba baakalila na ufulaha bileele. <verse eid="MRK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 5:39" />Nde akoti mu nzo na aleeli bo: «Mu hima benu lili mu muyunga na bililu? Mwana a haakwa ve, ka nde tolo haabwamina.» <verse eid="MRK 5:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 5:40" />Ka bo baakakwede nde. Buuna Yisu apalisi bo boosi, na avoli taata na ngu a mwana, na bayihi ba nde babatatu. Bo baakoti mu itini hya nzo hu hwaba mwana. <verse eid="MRK 5:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 5:41" />Yisu akaangi mwana mu hooho na aleeli huli nde: «Talita kume!» Mbindulili ni ti: «Nuumba, me miindeele we lo, suuha!»<verse eid="MRK 5:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 5:42" />Masulubete, nuumba yi yaaba na bilima kuumi na byole, asuuhi mu lipfu na abaandihi uyene. Bo boosi baakimuhi hu ulahi. <verse eid="MRK 5:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 5:43" />Ka Yisu asinzikebese bo mu uveleyabisa huli pasi muutu. Titswene, nde atumi bo mu uva nde byudya.<verse eid="MRK 5:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="MRK 6" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu bamiinyasula hu Nazareti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 13:53-58">Mty 13.53-58</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16-30">Luk 4.16-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 6:1" />Yisu amati ŋa mbuha mo yiina na ayeni hu musyenge wu nde haakuli. Bayihi ba nde baakaduukala nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:53">Mty 13.53</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:16">Luk 4.16</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 6:2" />Bu Saba yaatoodi, Yisu abaandihi ulongese mu nzo lisambulu yi Bayudaayo. Baatu ba balahi ba baakayuha ndongisili a nde, baakimuhi na baakafuula: «Maniima moosi huni mali mu uyiila nde? Ki pila a tsiki mo yiniiyi yi baava nde? Na buni bipadi bya pila mo yiniiyi bili mu uvangama mu myoho mya nde? <verse eid="MRK 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 6:3" />Wunuuwu a ni salapandi, mwana a Mariya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 6:42">Yow 6.42</ref></char></note>, mwana a ngu a Yaki, mwana a ngu a Yose, mwana a ngu a Yude, na mwana a ngu a Simoni ve? Bakedi ba nde a bubaatsahala na bisu ŋaaniŋa ve?» Maana moosi maakasa bo ikahu mu usa imiinu mu Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 6:4" />Na Yisu aleeli bo: «Bubaakiinza mumbihuli pasi tsyelo, vengo mu tsi a nde, ŋa hati bibaayaka ikuta hya nde na mu nzo a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:57">Mty 13.57</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 4:24">Luk 4.24</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 4:44">Yow 4.44</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 6:5" />Yisu a hakitwala uvaanga ipadi tso imosi ŋaana ve. Vengo ubeeloso hwa mwa babeedu mu usuusala hwa bo myoho<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 13:58">Mty 13.58</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 6:6" />Na nde akimuhi, mu pelili a bo yi imiinu.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 6:6">Yisu miitsindaha kuumi na bayihi boole mu isalu</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 6:6">
    <ref loc="MAT 10:5-15">Mty 10.5-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:1-6">Luk 9.1-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 6:6">Yisu akayene mu mala ma ibiingi mohiina, mu ubaalongese baatu mambu ma Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 6:7" />Yisu ateeli bayihi bakuumi na boole. Nde abaandihi utsindaha bo boole-boole na aviidi bo matwala ŋa yulu mavupu ma mabi. <verse eid="MRK 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 6:8" />Nde aviidi bo tumili mo yiniiyi: «A libita pasi isiha mu mudyenge a benu ve. Tso lipa, tso koome, tso mbongo mu mudi a luungu. Ka bitaani ndulu likaanda. <verse eid="MRK 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 6:9" />Lwataani bikoodi mu miilu mya benu na a libita biyunga byole ve.»<verse eid="MRK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 6:10" />Nde akabweleele bo: «Tso bayaki benu mu pasi nzo, kwilalaani muuna, natee bu benu luupala muuna. <verse eid="MRK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 6:11" />Tso baatu baveliyaka benu pasi tsyelo na baveliyuhala benu, bu benu luumata ŋaana, kubalaani mufuundu a mataambi ma benu. Hiina hyuba iliimbu hya kebisili a bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:14">Mty 10.14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:5">Luk 9.5</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:51">Mav 13.51</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 18:6">18.6</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 6:12" />Ni mu buuna, bayihi baayeni mu ulongese baatu mu usobo mbiili a bo. <verse eid="MRK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 6:13" />Bo baakabinga matengo ma malahi, baakakila maadi mu babeedu ba balahi na baakabeeloso bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JAS 5:14">Yak 5.14</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lipfu la Yowani Mutondihi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:1-12">Mty 14.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:7-9">Luk 9.7-9</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 6:14" />Mutumi Eloode ayuhi tsangu a Yisu, mu tooni ati, nduhi a nde yaadumi na baatu baakaleele: «Yowani Mutondihi miisuuha mu babaakwa! Ni mu buuna nde ali mu uvaanga bipadi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 6:15" />Bakima baakaleele ti: «Nde ni mumbihuli Eliya.» Bakima kaka ti: «Nde mumbihuli wu afwanina na mumosi mu mimbihuli mya tsikulu.» <verse eid="MRK 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 6:16" />Ka bu Eloode haakayuha ma Yisu haakavaanga, nde aleeli: «Wunuwu ni Yowani wu me atumi baatu mu ukese mutswe, miisuuha mu babaakwa!»<verse eid="MRK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 6:17" />Mu mbuli Eloode nde mwakulu atsindihi baatu mu ukaanga Yowani. Nde atumi baahada Yowani mapaanga na ukotese nde mu kondaayi. Nde haasiidi buuna, mu tooni a Elodyadi, wu Eloode haapatuli mu ukwele tso bu nde haaba mukadi a mwana a ngu a nde Filipo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:3">Mty 14.3</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 3:19">Luk 3.19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:9">9.9</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 6:18" />Ni mu buuna, Eloode haakotisi Yowani kondaayi, mu tooni ati, Yowani aleeli nde ti: «A baava we muswa wu ukwele mukadi a mwana a ngu a we ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 8:16">Lev 8.16</ref>; <ref loc="LEV 20:21">20.21</ref> </char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 6:19" />Elodyadi akabelele Yowani na akataasa uduba nde, ka nde a haakatwala ve. <verse eid="MRK 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 6:20" />Eye, Eloode aba na boomo bwa Yowani, bu nde haaba haayaba ti Yowani muutu wa tsiitsa na wa ngidi. Buuna, Eloode akakalila nde. Ŋa nde haakayuha Yowani mu utoyo, Eloode aba na matsimi helini-helini. Ka nde akamono kinya mu uyuha bu Yowani haakatoyo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 14:5">Mty 14.5</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:26">21.26</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 6:21" />Ka ilumbu imosi, mu taangu yi yaayelemene, Eloode amoni bubwe mu uvangimasa ilaambu hi ilumbu hya mbutili a nde. Nde ateeli mu uyadya, bapfumu ba lituma la nde, bakuutu ba balwani na baatu ba likiinzu batsomi ba itaanzi hya Ngalili. <verse eid="MRK 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 6:22" />Mwana a Elodyadi wu mukaasu, akoti mu nzo na akini. Nde amweesi Eloode na byenyi kinya. Buuna, mutumi Eloode aleeli huli nuumba mo wunuwu: «Vondo me pasi isiha hi we toondi, me tsa pa we hyo.» <verse eid="MRK 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 6:23" />Titswene, Eloode alabi nde mulabu mo wunuwu: «Pasi bi we uvondo me, me tsa pa we byo. Tso hwaaba itini imosi mu byole hi Ipfumu hya me.» <verse eid="MRK 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 6:24" />Nuumba apali na afuuli ngu a nde: «Hima me upondo?» Ngu a nde akaali nde: «Mutswe a Yowani Mutondihi.» <verse eid="MRK 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 6:25" />Nuumba abingilili ufutaha huli mutumi, mu uyabisa nde pondili mo yiniiyi: «Me toondi ti mawasa maniima, we va me mutswe a Yowani Mutondihi ŋa yulu a lyengo!» <verse eid="MRK 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 6:26" />Mutumi akoti mu lingebe; ka nde a haatondi ubisala pondili a Elodyadi ve, mu tooni milabu mi nde haasiidi ŋa busu bwa byenyi bya nde. <verse eid="MRK 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 6:27" />Eloode atsindihi masulubete lisadaadu limosi mu bakeedi ba nde, na aviidi lo tumili yi ubehele nde mutswe a Yowani Mutondihi. Lisadaadu laayeni hu kondaayi na laakesi mutswe a Yowani. <verse eid="MRK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 6:28" />Titswene, lisadaadu laabehi mutswe ŋa lyengo na aviidi huli nuumba, wu ayava nde huli ngu a nde. <verse eid="MRK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 6:29" />Bu bayihi ba Yowani baayuhi musamu, bo baayidi mu uvolo nyutu a nde na baasuusi yo mutso a ngila.<verse eid="MRK 6:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu na bayihi ba nde bamiibuungala koonge a baatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:13-21">Mty 14.13-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:10-17">Luk 9.10-17</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:1-14">Yow 6.1-14</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 6:30" />Biluumbi bya Yisu byayakuukama ŋa pedu a nde, na byayabisi nde moosi ma bo baasiidi na moosi ma bo baalongisi. <verse eid="MRK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 6:31" />Na Yisu aleeli bo: «Yaani ŋa muvanga, ŋa mbuha a tswehi na vuumaani hoole.» Nde haaleeli buuna, mu tooni ati, baatu ba balahi baakaya na baakafutaha, buuna bo a baakabaha tso taangu yi udya ve. <verse eid="MRK 6:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 6:32" />Buuna, Yisu na biluumbi bya nde, baayeni mu hyabu ŋa muvanga ŋa mbuha yi ive na ive. <verse eid="MRK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 6:33" />Ka, baatu ba balahi baamoni bo mu utahuha na baadihuli bo. Baatu baamati mu misyenge mya bebele myosi matiinu, na baateehili bo uto mu miilu hu bo baakayene. <verse eid="MRK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 6:34" />Taangu yi Yisu hasutihi mu hyabu, nde amoni koonge a baatu yinene. Na mutima a nde aluuli mu lingebe la bo mu tooni ati, bo baabeedi we mameme ma maavele a keedi. Buuna, nde abaandihi ulongese bo bisiha bi bilahi. <verse eid="MRK 6:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 6:35" />Bu busi bwaaba bwaka beleve, bayihi ba Yisu baayasusaha ŋa pedu a nde na baaleeli nde: «Busi bwamiiyila, na mbuha mo yiniiyi yi ive na ive. <verse eid="MRK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 6:36" />Futala baatu mo baniiba, bayene mu mala na bitsaka bi ibiingi mo hiniihi, mana bo bayasuumba byudya bya bo.» <verse eid="MRK 6:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 6:37" />Ka Yisu akaali bo: «Vaani bo byudya benu mwakulu!» Bayihi baafuuli nde: «Bisu liyene liyatsinda makama moole (200) ma badenye<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 20:2">Mty 20.2</ref> </char></note> mu usuumba mapa, na liva bo byudya?» <verse eid="MRK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 6:38" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Mapa kwe benu lili na mo? Yenaani, yamonwaani.» Bo baayafuula na baayaleele nde: «Bisu na mapa mataanu na batswi boole.» <verse eid="MRK 6:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 6:39" />Buuna, Yisu aviidi bo tumili mu utsahisa baatu boosi mu makabu-makabu ŋa yulu a biimbu bi bibisu. <verse eid="MRK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 6:40" />Na bo baatsahili mu miloongo mya kama (100) la baatu na mu miloongo mi maku mataanu ma baatu. <verse eid="MRK 6:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 6:41" />Yisu avoli mapa ma mataanu na batswi baboole. Asiimbuli miisu hu yulu na asambili mu uvondo lisyeme. Titswene, atabuli mapa na aviidi mo huli bayihi, mu ukabila huli koonge a baatu. Yisu akabi kaka batswi baboole huli boosi. <verse eid="MRK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 6:42" />Boosi baadiidi na baaywaati. <verse eid="MRK 6:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 6:43" />Na bayihi baatoli na baabehi byebe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">6.43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 4:42-44">2Pf 4.42-44</ref></char></note> kuumi na byole bi byaluuli mu bitini bi mapa na bi batswi bi byasalili. <verse eid="MRK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 6:44" />Litangu la baatu ba baadiidi mapa, aba biveeve bitaanu (5 000) bi babahala.<verse eid="MRK 6:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu bibaayaka mu uyene ŋa yulu a mamba</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:22-33">Mty 14.22-33</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 6:15-21">Yow 6.15-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 6:45" />Titswene, masulubete Yisu atumi bayihi ba nde mu uvaata mu hyabu, mana bo bateehele nde hu simu lina la dyanga, hu tsyelo musyenge a Betesayida, bu nde mwakulu huusaala afutala makonge ma baatu. <verse eid="MRK 6:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 6:46" />Bu nde haamani ufutala bo, nde ayeni hu yulu isyelo mu usambila. <verse eid="MRK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 6:47" />Bu tsitsaha yaatoodi, hyabu hyaba hyaka ŋa butima bwa dyanga, na Yisu asaali nde siha ŋa simu. <verse eid="MRK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 6:48" />Nde amoni ti bayihi ba nde baaba na muvinyu mu utsindahala hyabu mu manaangu ma bo, mu tooni ifula hi hyakabwana bo. Ni mu buuna, teehele busi bukya, Yisu ayeni mu miilu ŋa yulu a mamba, na nde akiivyoho bo. <verse eid="MRK 6:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 6:49" />Bu bayihi baamoni nde mu uyene mu miilu ŋa yulu a mamba, bo baatsimi ti wuuna aba mukuyi, na bo baafulihi. <verse eid="MRK 6:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 6:50" />Mu tooni ati, bo boosi baakamono nde, na bo baaba na boomo. Ka masulubete, Yisu aleeli bo: «Hwadaani! Wunuwu me. A liba na boomo ve!» <verse eid="MRK 6:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 6:51" />Titswene, Yisu akoti na abiisili bo mutso a hyabu, na ifula hyavudimini. Bayihi baasinzikimuha, <verse eid="MRK 6:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 6:52" />bu bo baavelitsikaha ipadi hi mapa: mitima mya bo myaba myakangama.<verse eid="MRK 6:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso babeedu hu Ngenezareti</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 14:34-36">Mty 14.34-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 6:53" />Hu mbisa a tsabuhili, bo baatoodi hu itaanzi hya Ngenezareti, na bo baasiingihi hyabu ŋa simu. <verse eid="MRK 6:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 6:54" />Bu bo baasutihi mu hyabu, masulubete, baatu baadihuli Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 6:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 6:55" />Buuna, baatu baataangili itaanzi hyoosi matiinu, na baakabehele nde babeedu ŋa yulu bipoyi, pasi hu bo baakayuha ti: «Yisu ndyowunuuwu ŋaniiŋa!» <verse eid="MRK 6:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 6:56" />Pasi tsyelo yi Yisu haakayene, mu mala, mu misyenge, na mu bitsaka, baatu baakasuusa babeedu mu matandala ma mikungi, na baakayayaana nde mu unyaha ti babeedu babeleene tso tsoso ikutu hya nde. Na boosi ba baakabeembe nde, baakafuuha.<verse eid="MRK 6:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="MRK 7" />
  <para style="s1">Bukulu bu bakaaha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:1-20">Mty 15.1-20</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 7:1" />Bafarisi na mwa milongisi mi Mikele ba baamati hu Yeruselemi, baakuukimi ŋa pedu a Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 7:2" />Bo baamoni mwa bayihi ba nde bakima mu udya na myoho mi myasumaha, mbindulili ni ti mi baaveleswaha, we bu hu bibaayaka bukulu. <verse eid="MRK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 7:3" />Ni mu buuna, Bafarisi we Bayudaayo boosi a bubaadya hwavele umaswaha makaka na bungeele ve, bu bo baakangama mu bukulu bu bakaaha ba bo. <verse eid="MRK 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 7:4" />Na ŋa bo bubaamata hu saandu, bo ubaadya ndulu ŋa bamiimana upuupala maamba mu utsyemese nyutu a bo. Bo bubaakiinza kaka matsalili makima ma malahi ma bukulu, we uswaha hu mambuungu, na mihudu, na masanga ma baayuha mu bitali.<verse eid="MRK 7:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 7:5" />Bafarisi na milongisi mi Mikele baafuuli Yisu: «Mu hima bayihi ba we baaveleduukala bukulu bu bakaaha, na ubaadya na myoho mi myasumaha?» <verse eid="MRK 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 7:6" />Yisu akaali bo: «Benu ba nga muwala lili! Esaya aba na mbiinga ŋa nde habihuli bubwe mu tooni a benu, Mabasonehe:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">“Baatu mo baniiba bubaayuusa me mu bibodu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:6">ka mitima mya bo myasinzatahuha na me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Esa 29.13</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 33:31">Ezk 33.31</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 7:6" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 7:7" />Mu pu baatu mo baniiba bali mu ukuunda me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">ndongisili yi bo bali mu ulongese</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 7:7">yili ndulu matumili ma baatu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 29:13">Esa 29.13</ref></char></note>.”<verse eid="MRK 7:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 7:8" />Benu lili mu utiimba matumili ma Nzambi, buleeli Yisu, mu uduukala bukulu bu imuutu.»<verse eid="MRK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 7:9" />Yisu akabweleele bo: «Benu lili ba baavangama bubwe mu unyasula matumili ma Nzambi, mana livatahana mu bukulu bwa benu mwakulu! <verse eid="MRK 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 7:10" />Mu tooni ati Moose aleeli: “Kiinza taata a we na ngu a we”, na: “Woosi wu usinga taata a nde buuve ngu a nde, sa baduba nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12">Pal 20.12</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16">Pfu 5.16</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 6:2">Efe 6.2</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 21:17">Pal 21.17</ref>; <ref loc="EXO 20:9">20.9</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 27:16">Pfu 27.16</ref>; <ref loc="PRO 20:20">Mak 20.20</ref> </char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 7:11" />Ka benu lili mu uleele huli muutu: “We na muswa wu uleele huli taata a we buuve huli ngu a we ti: Kabu la bya me bi me akiipa we mu ukumbasa we ni korobani”, mbindulili ni ti “bungodu bu baaswehele Nzambi”. <verse eid="MRK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 7:12" />Na benu lili mu uva muswa huli muutu mo wuuna, mu ubwevelevangila taata a nde buuve ngu a nde isiha tso imosi! <verse eid="MRK 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 7:13" />Buuna, benu libaafwinzala mambu ma Nzambi mu usalila bukulu bwa benu. Na benu lili mu uvaanga bisiha bi bilahi bya pila yiina.»<verse eid="MRK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 7:14" />Yisu abweteele koonge a baatu na aleeli bo: «Yuhaani me, benu boosi na tsikahaani bubwe: <verse eid="MRK 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 7:15" />A hu bibaayaka na isiha tso imosi hi hili hu mbadi hi hibaakoto mu nyutu a muutu hi hyutwala usumana nde ve. Ka hi hili mu upala mu muutu, hiina ni hi hili mu usumana nde.» <verse eid="MRK 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 7:16" />[Tso muutu bibaayaka na matswi mu uyuha, nyaha nde ayuha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.16 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mabuuku makima, a mali mu umweese itini mo hiniihi ve.</char></note>.]<verse eid="MRK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 7:17" />Bu Yisu haakoti mu nzo, lala na koonge, bayihi ba nde baafuuli nde mu tooni a kuma mo yiina. <verse eid="MRK 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 7:18" />Nde aleeli bo: «Benu kaka kaahu buyedi ve? Benu a lili mu utsikaha ve? Isiha tso imosi hya hu mbadi utwala usumana muutu ve, tso hyo hikoti mu nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 7:19" />Buuna, bisiha mo biina a bili mu ukoto hutso mutima a nde ve, ka hutso a moonyi a nde, mana hu mbisa byo bipala mu uyene hu mwaasa.» Mu maambu mo maana, Yisu akaleele ti byudya byosi bi byatsyeme bili<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 10:9-16">Mav 10.9-16</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 7:20" />Nde abweleele: «Ni hi hili mu upala mu muutu hili mu usumana nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 7:21" />Mu tooni ati, ni hu hati, hutso mutima a muutu hubaapala matsimi ma mabi, mo mu baabita nde hu bulaala, hu yiba, hu uduba, <verse eid="MRK 7:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 7:22" />hu mayamba, hu ngaabi, hu bukanyi, hu mapfuta, hu buyahudi, hu linyungi, hu bituhi, hu nyeme, hu pelili a nzuhili. <verse eid="MRK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 7:23" />Bisiha mo biniibi byosi bibibi, bili mu upala hu hati na bibaasumana muutu.»<verse eid="MRK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imiinu hi mukaasu wa musi Fenisiya ya hu Siriya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:21-28">Mty 15.21-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 7:24" />Yisu amati ŋaana na ayeni hu itaanzi hya Tiilo. Nde akoti mu nzo mosi na a haatoondi ti muutu tso mumosi ayaaba ve, ka nde a haatwali uswemene ve. <verse eid="MRK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 7:25" />Mukaasu mumosi wu mwana wa nuumba haaba na livupu lilibi, ayuhi tsaangu a Yisu na mu mawasa, ayabwa ŋa miilu mya nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 7:26" />Mukaasu mo wuuna aba mungeleke, musi Fenisiya ya hu Siriya. Nde avondi huli Yisu mu ubinga tengo bibaayaka laaba mu mwana a nde. <verse eid="MRK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 7:27" />Ka Yisu aleeli nde: «Nyaha baana bamaaywata, mu tooni ati, a hu bibaayaka bubwe mu uvolo lipa la baana na ubuma lo huli baana ba bamvwa ve». <verse eid="MRK 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 7:28" />Mukaasu afutili nde: «Pfumu, baana ba bamvwa kaka hu tsina a metse, bubaadya bipepesi bi baana bubaabwisa.» <verse eid="MRK 7:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 7:29" />Buuna Yisu aleeli nde: «Mu tooni a dyambu bibaayaka we miileele liniili, yene: tengo limiipala mu mwana a we wu mukaasu.» <verse eid="MRK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 7:30" />Bu mukaasu haafutihi hu nzo a nde, nde abiisi mwana a nde alaambama ŋa yulu a taangi: tengo laaba laamiipala mu nde.<verse eid="MRK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 7:31" />Yisu abwemata itaanzi hya Tiilo, na ayafutaha mu nzila a Sidoni hu tsyelo a dyanga la Ngalili. Nde asabuhi itaanzi hya Dekapoli hyoosi.<verse eid="MRK 7:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso ikwa-matswi nga muvinyu mu utoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 7:32" />Bamiibehele Yisu ikwa-matswi hi hili na muvinyu mu utoyo, na bamiiyayaana nde mu usuusala hyo hoho<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:32">Mty 9.32</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 11:14">Luk 11.14</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 7:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 7:33" />Yisu abiti hyo ŋa muvaanga, lala na koonge, akotisi muutu mo wuuna mileembo mutso matswi, na abeembi limi mu maate ma nde mwakulu Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 7:34" />Titswene, nde asiimbuli miisu hu yulu, asuusi ivuumi na aleeli huli muutu mo: «Efata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7.34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Efata</char><char style="ft" closed="false">ikuma hya mu ndaha yi Irameyene.</char></note>!» Mbindulili ni ti: «Dibuma!» <verse eid="MRK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 7:35" />Masulubete, matswi ma nde maadibumi, limi la nde laanyanguhi na nde akayambila we bu hwafwana. <verse eid="MRK 7:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 7:36" />Yisu asinzikebese baatu mu uveleyabisa lo huli pasi muutu. Ka bu nde haakafulala ukebese bo, bo baakasinzafulala utsala musamu. <verse eid="MRK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 7:37" />Baatu baaba mu kimuhili yi yaafulala na baakaleele: «Moosi ma nde ali mu uvaanga, mu mbuli mali ma mabwe! Nde bibaayaka mu uyuhasa bikwa-matswi napa utoyese biduka!»<verse eid="MRK 7:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="MRK 8" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiliisala biveeve bina bya baatu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 15:32-39">Mty 15.32-39</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 8:1" />Mu bilumbu mo biina, koonge yinene ya baatu yaabweyadiinga Yisu. Bu bo baaba baavele na byudya, Yisu ateeli bayihi ba nde na aleeli bo. <verse eid="MRK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 8:2" />«Me ndi mu umono lingebe mu tooni a baatu mo baniiba. Lolo yiniiyi huka bilumbu bitatu bi bo bali mu ukwilala na me, na bo a bali na tso isiha hyudya ve. <verse eid="MRK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 8:3" />Tso me pfutili bo mu manzo ma bo nzala, bo buukolo binama mu nzila, mu tooni ati, bamosi mu bo baamata lala.» <verse eid="MRK 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 8:4" />Bayihi ba nde baafutili nde: «Huni luutwala ubaha mapa ma uywatisa bo ŋa ibiingi hi ive na ive hiniihi?» <verse eid="MRK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 8:5" />Yisu afuuli bo: «Mapa kwe benu lili na mo?» Bo baaleeli: «Tsambu.» <verse eid="MRK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 8:6" />Nde atumi koonge a baatu mu utsahala ŋa toto. Titswene, hu mbisa uvolo mapa matsambu na ufutala matondo huli Nzambi, nde akesi mo na aviidi huli bayihi ba nde mu ukabila huli boosi. Bo baakabi mo huli koonge a baatu. <verse eid="MRK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 8:7" />Bo baabweba kaka na mwana a batswi. Hu mbisa umana usyeme batswi, Yisu abweleele huli bayihi mu ukaba kaka batswi. <verse eid="MRK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 8:8" />Baatu baadiidi na baaywaati, na baatoli byebe tsambu bi byaluuli mu bitini bi mapa bi byasalili. <verse eid="MRK 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 8:9" />Litangu la ba baaba baatsahala ŋaana aba bebele biveeve bina (4 000). Titswene Yisu afutili bo. <verse eid="MRK 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 8:10" />Masulubete, nde anami hyabu na bayihi ba nde na baayeni hu itaanzi hya Dalamanuta.<verse eid="MRK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bafarisi bali mu uvondo iliimbu hya kimuhili huli Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:1-4">Mty 16.1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 8:11" />Bafarisi baayidi, baabaandihi ukaakana na Yisu mu utehele nde mweto. Bo baakasaha iliimbu hya kimuhili hi hyumata hu yulu. <verse eid="MRK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 8:12" />Yisu asuusi ivuumi na aleeli: «Mu hima baatu ba tuungi mo liniili bali mu usaha iliimbu? Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, a buuva iliimbu tso imosi huli tuungi mo liniili ve!» <verse eid="MRK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 8:13" />Buuna, nde asiisi bo na abwenama mu hyabu mu uyene hu simu lina.<verse eid="MRK 8:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Levure bibaayaka bafarisi na la Eloode</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 8:14" />Bayihi baavusihini ubita mapa. Bo baaba ndulu na lipa limosi mutso a hyabu. <verse eid="MRK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 8:15" />Yisu aviidi bo tumili mo yiniiyi: «Dibulaani miisu! Kebaani mu levure<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">levure</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Iloho hi hibaadanisa paate.</char></note> bibaayaka Bafarisi na mu levure la Eloode<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 16:6">Mty 16.6</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 12:1">Luk 12.1</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 8:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 8:16" />Bayihi baakakaakana ŋa hati la bo mu tooni ati, bo a baabeedi na mapa ve. <verse eid="MRK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 8:17" />Bu Yisu haayaabi ma maakavyoho, nde afuuli bo: «Mu hima benu lili mu ukaakana na uleele ti benu a lili na mapa ve? Benu a laasinzatsikaha ve? Benu nzaabili ve? Mitima mya benu bunono mili?<verse eid="MRK 8:17" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 8:18" />Benu lili na miisu,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 8:18">na benu a lili mu umono ve?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 8:18">Benu lili na matswi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 8:18">na benu a lili mu uyuha ve?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 8:18">Benu a lili mu uyibwala moonyi ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JER 5:21">Yel 5.21</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 12:2">Ezk 12.2</ref></char></note>,<verse eid="MRK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 8:19" />Ŋa me atabuli na ukaba mapa ma mataanu huli biveeve bi bitaanu bya baatu, byebe kwe bi byaluuli mu bitini bi mapa benu laabiti?» Bo baafutili: «Kuumi na byole.» <verse eid="MRK 8:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 8:20" />«Na ŋa me akesi mapa matsambu mu tooni a biveeve bina bya baatu, byebe kwe bi byaluuli mu bitini bi mapa benu laabiti?» Bo baafutili: «Tsambu.» <verse eid="MRK 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 8:21" />Buuna Yisu aleeli bo: «Benu kini a laamaatsikaha ve?»<verse eid="MRK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso inzimana</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 8:22" />Bo bamiito hu Betesayida; baatu bamiibehele Yisu inzimana, na bamiiyayaana nde mu ubeembe nde. <verse eid="MRK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 8:23" />Yisu akaangi inzimana mu hooho na abiti nde hu muvaanga a bula. Titswene hu mbisa utuutala nde maate mu miisu, nde asuusili nde myoho na afuuli nde: «We miimono isiha?» <verse eid="MRK 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 8:24" />Inzimana hyasiimbuli miisu na hyaleeli: «Me ndi mu umono baatu; bo bali we miti mi me ndi mu umono mu uyene.» <verse eid="MRK 8:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 8:25" />Titswene, Yisu abwesuusala myoho ŋa yulu a miisu ma muutu mo. Nde amoni bubwe-bubwe: nde abeeluhi, nde akamono bisiha byosi na lisobosono. <verse eid="MRK 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 8:26" />Buuna, Yisu afutili nde hu nzo a nde na aleeli: «A haabila hwawe ukoto tso hutso a bula.»<verse eid="MRK 8:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo miisilasa ti Yisu ni Masiya</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 16:13-20">Mty 16.13-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:18-21">Luk 9.18-21</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 8:27" />Titswene, Yisu na bayihi ba nde baayeni hu tsyelo a mala ma mali bebele na Sezare ya Filipo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">8.27 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Sezare ya Filipo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">musyenge wu bibaayaka bebele na mitswe mya nzali a Yolodani, wu Filipo haatuungi.</char></note>. Mu nzila, nde akafuula bayihi ba nde: «Mu uyuha bitoyili bya baatu, ti na me ndi?» <verse eid="MRK 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 8:28" />Bo baafutili nde: «Bamosi bali mu uleele ti, we Yowani Mutondihi we bibaayaka, bakima ti, we Eliya we bibaayaka; bakima kaka ti, we mumosi mu mimbihuli we bibaayaka.» <verse eid="MRK 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 8:29" />Na Yisu afuuli bo: «Ka benu buni lileeli, ti me na me ndi?» Peetelo akaali nde: «We ni Masiya!» <verse eid="MRK 8:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 8:30" />Yisu akebisi bo mu mifudi, mu uveleyambila mu nde huli pasi muutu.<verse eid="MRK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yisu miiyabisa lipfu la nde na miisyembe Peetelo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 8:31" />Yisu abaandihi ulongese bo ti hwafwana ti Mwana a muutu asinzamono pasi, banyanza nde huli mikukunyungu, huli bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na huli milongisi mi Mikele; hwafwana ti baduba nde, na nde asuuha mu babaakwa humbisa bilumbu bitatu. <verse eid="MRK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 8:32" />Nde akaleele dyambu mo liina paayalala. Buuna, Peetelo abiti nde ŋa muvanga na abaandihi usyembe nde. <verse eid="MRK 8:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 8:33" />Ka Yisu akinguhi, atali bayihi ba nde na asyembi Peetelo hu unono: «Yene, vyoho hu mbisa a me, Saatana! Mu tooni ati, matsimi ma we a mali matsimi ma Nzambi ve, ka mo mali ma baatu.»<verse eid="MRK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="s">Buni laafwana uduukala Yisu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 8:34" />Yisu ateeli koonge a baatu na bayihi ba nde na aleeli bo: «Tso muutu tondi uduukala me, anyaha utsima mambu ma nde mwakulu, nde abita kuruwa a nde pasi ilumbu, na aduukala me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8.34 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 10:38">Mty 10.38</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 16:24">16.24</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:23">Luk 9.23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:27">14.27</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 8:35" />Buuna, muutu wu toondi ufuuhasa idiingu hya nde, unyambasana hyo; ka wu unyambasana idiingu hya nde mu tooni a me, na mu tooni a Musamu wu Mubwe, ufuuhasa hyo. <verse eid="MRK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 8:36" />Ki kaluha muutu hubaha tso nde bahi toto yoosi, na uvinda muvumu a nde? <verse eid="MRK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 8:37" />Hima muutu huutwala uva ŋa ikiisa hi idiingu hya nde? <verse eid="MRK 8:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 8:38" />Ni mu buuna, woosi wu umono tsonyi mu me na mu mambu ma me ŋa busu bwa tuungi bibaayaka mayamba na la tsumihili mo liniili, Mwana a Muutu kaka umono tsonyi mu nde, ŋa nde huuya hutso muyusu a Taata a nde na bapofi bangidi.»<verse eid="MRK 8:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="MRK 9" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 9:1" />Yisu akabweleele bo: «Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu: mwana a baatu bakima mu ba bali ŋaniiŋa, a buubiimba lipfu ve, teehele bo bamono Ipfumu hya Nzambi mu uya na matwala.»<verse eid="MRK 9:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kimbuhili a Yisu na Eliya ŋa yulu isyelo</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:1-13">Mty 17.1-13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:28-36">Luk 9.28-36</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 9:2" />Hu mbisa bilumbu bisamunu, Yisu miivolo Peetelo, Yaki na Yowani. Nde miibita bo hu yulu isyelo hi hyasyenoho hu baaba siha ŋa muvaanga. Na nde akimbuhi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">akimbuhi</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Usobo linyutu.</char></note> ŋa busu bwa bo. <verse eid="MRK 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 9:3" />Bikutu bya nde byakamwedeme mu lifuuku bibaayaka laafulala, bibaayaka pasi mukili mapiti ŋa toto huveletwala ufuukasa mu iteesi mo hiina<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.3 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2PE 1:16-18">2Pe 1.16-18</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 9:4" />Buuna, Eliya ayamonehele na bo itwadi na Moose; na bo baboole baakamoho na Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 9:5" />Peetelo abakuli na aleeli huli Yisu: «Rabi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.5 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rabi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbindulili ni ti: Mulongisi mu ndaha ya Arameneye.</char></note>, hu bibaayaka bubwe ti bisu a benu litsahalaani ŋaniiŋa. Nyaha lituungaani bitudu bitatu, imosi hya we, imosi hya Moose na imosi hya Eliya.» <verse eid="MRK 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 9:6" />Peetelo a haaba na bibaayaka uleele ve, mu tooni ati, boomo bwaaba bwaamiikaanga bayihi. <verse eid="MRK 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 9:7" />Yidu limosi laayafuungala bo mu posi a lo, na ndaha mosi yaapali mutso a lo: «Nde wunuwu ni Mwana a me wu litondo, yuhalaani nde!» <verse eid="MRK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 9:8" />Masulubete, bayihi baatala tsyelo na tsyelo, bo a baabwemono muutu tso mumosi ve, vengo Yisu, nde siha na bo. <verse eid="MRK 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 9:9" />Bu bo baakakulamana isyelo, Yisu akebisi bo mu uveleyabisa huli pasi muutu ma bo baamoni, natee bu Mwana a muutu huusuuha ŋa hati la babaakwa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 17:9">Mty 17.9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:36">Luk 9.36</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 9:10" />Bo baaduukili tumili mo yiina, ka bo baakatsotsosono: «Mbindulili a “usuuha ŋa hati la babaakwa ni hima”?»<verse eid="MRK 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 9:11" />Titswene, bayihi baafuuli Yisu: «Mu hima milongisi mi Mikele mibaaleele ti Eliya afwana umaaya<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:23">Mal 3.23</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:14">Mty 11.14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 1:17">Luk 1.17</ref> </char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 9:12" />Yisu afutili bo: «Eliya afwana umaaya, mu uvangimasa bisiha byosi. Ka buni Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mu baasilasa kaka ti, Mwana a muutu afwana umaamono pasi yindahi, na buurokolo nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:1-18">Mkg 22.1-18</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53:3">Esa 53.3</ref></char></note>? <verse eid="MRK 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 9:13" />Eye, me ndeele benu ti Eliya aba amiiya, na bo baavangili nde moosi ma bo baatoondi, we bu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uyabisa mu nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 4:5-6">Mlk 4.5-6</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso mwana nga livupu lilibi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:14-21">Mty 17.14-21</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:37-43a">Luk 9.37-43a</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 9:14" />Bu bo baabiisili bayihi bakima, bo baamoni koonge a baatu ba balahi yaadiinga bo, na milongisi mi Mikele mi myakakaakana na bo. <verse eid="MRK 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 9:15" />Masulubete, bu koonge a baatu yaamoni Yisu, yo yaakimuhi, na baatu baakayene tiinu mu uyabila nde. <verse eid="MRK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 9:16" />Yisu afuuli bo: «Mu ki musamu benu lili mu ukaakana na bo?» <verse eid="MRK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 9:17" />Na muutu mumosi mutso a koonge afutili nde: «Mulongisi, me miimbehele we mwana a me wa bahala, wu bibaayaka na livupu bibaayaka buduka. <verse eid="MRK 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 9:18" />Pasi tsyelo yi livupu luukaanga nde, lo libaabwisa nde ŋa toto; mwana ubaanzunzama, ubaakweete miinyu, na nde ubaararama. Me apondi bayihi ba we mu ubinga livupu mo liniili, ka bo a baabahi mifudi ve.» <verse eid="MRK 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 9:19" />Yisu afutili bo: «Mbaandu yi yaavele na imiinu. Natee ki taangu me umba na benu? Natee ki taangu me ukuunda benu? Behelaani me mwana.» <verse eid="MRK 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 9:20" />Baabehili nde mwana. Mawasa-mawasa bu livupu laamoni Yisu, lo laapfwikisi mwana na unzunzama; nde abwiidi ŋa toto; na akabungamana na upalisa mafudi. <verse eid="MRK 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 9:21" />Yisu afuuli taata a mwana: «Umata matangu kwe miniimi mili mu uyiila nde?» Nde afutili: «Umata bukenyi bwa nde. <verse eid="MRK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 9:22" />Taangu kima, livupu lilibi libaatsindahala nde hutso a mbaahu buuve hutso a nzali, mu uduba nde. Ka tso we utwala uvaanga isiha, kwila bisu lingebe na yaanga yaakumbasa bisu!» <verse eid="MRK 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 9:23" />Yisu ni ukaala: «We miileele ti tso me utwala uvaanga isiha. Ka moosi utwala uvangama huli wu ubaasa imiinu!» <verse eid="MRK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 9:24" />Masulubete, taata a mwana afulihi: «Me ndi mu utsa imiinu.Yaanga yaakumbasa me mu pelili a me yi imiinu!»<verse eid="MRK 9:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 9:25" />Bu Yisu haamoni koonge a baatu mu uya tiinu hu pedu a bo, nde afwengili livupu lilibi na uleele lo: «livupu bibaayaka buduka na bibaayaka bukwa-matswi, me ndi mu utuma we, pala mu mwana mo wunuwu na a habwekoto mu nde!» <verse eid="MRK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 9:26" />Livupu laafulihi mubabu, laapfwikisi mwana mu mifudi na laapali mu nde. Mwana akituhi we wu akwa na ba balahi baakaleele: «Nde miikwa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 9:27" />Ka Yisu akaangi mwana mu hooho, atelimisi nde na nde atelimi. <verse eid="MRK 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 9:28" />Ŋa Yisu haakoti hu nzo, bayihi ba nde baaba siha na nde na baafuuli nde: «Mu hima bisu livelitwala ubinga livupu mo liniili?» <verse eid="MRK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 9:29" />Yisu akaali bo: «Ndulu ni lisambulu luutwala upalisa livupu la pila mo yiina.»<verse eid="MRK 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibweyabisa lipfu na tsuuhili a nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 17:22-23">Mty 17.22-23</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:43b-45">Luk 9.43b-45</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 9:30" />Bu bo baamati ŋaana, bo baasabuhi Ngalili na Yisu a haatoondi ti baatu bayaaba lo ve. <verse eid="MRK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 9:31" />Mono ma nde haakalongese bayihi ba nde: «Mwana a muutu bamiiyeholo ŋa myoho mya baatu. Bo buuduba nde na hu mbisa bilumbu bitatu, nde usuuha mu babaakwa.» <verse eid="MRK 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 9:32" />Ka bayihi ba nde a baakatsikaha mambu mo maana ve, na bo baaba na boomo mu uva nde byuhu.<verse eid="MRK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Na afulala bukuutu?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:1-5">Mty 18.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 9:46-48">Luk 9.46-48</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 9:33" />Bo baayato hu Kapernahumi. Bu Yisu haayato hu nzo, nde afuuli bayihi ba nde: «Mu ki dyambu benu likatsotsosono mu nzila?» <verse eid="MRK 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 9:34" />Ka bo baaba swii, mu tooni ati, mu nzila, bo baakaatsotsosono mu uyaaba na ŋa hati la bo afulala bukuutu. <verse eid="MRK 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 9:35" />Buuna, Yisu atsahili, ateeli bayihi bakuumi na boole na aleeli bo: «Tso muutu toondi uba watsomi, nde afwana uba wa tsyelele na musalili a boosi.» <verse eid="MRK 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 9:36" />Ni mu buuna, nde avoli mwana mumosi, asuusi nde ŋa butima bwa bo. Nde abuumbi mwana na aleeli bo: <verse eid="MRK 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 9:37" />«Woosi wu uyaka mwana mumosi wa pila yiniiyi mu nduhi a me, miiyaka me. Na woosi wu uyaka me, a me nde amiiyaka ve, ka ni wuuna wu atsindaha me.»<verse eid="MRK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Wu avelebelele bisu, bibaayaka wa bisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 9:49-50">Luk 9.49-50</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 9:38" />Yowani aleeli Yisu: «Mulongisi, bisu laamono muutu mumosi mu ubinga matengo mu nduhi a we. Na bisu laasaha ukubasa nde lo, mu tooni ati, nde a hali mu uduukala bisu ve.» <verse eid="MRK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 9:39" />Yisu afutili nde: «A laakubasa nde mu usa buuna mu tooni ati, a hu bibaayaka na muutu wu utwala uvaanga ipadi mu nduhi a me ve, na masulubete, nde atoyo bubi mu me. <verse eid="MRK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 9:40" />Ni mu buuna, woosi wu avelebelele bisu a benu, bibaayaka wa bisu a benu. <verse eid="MRK 9:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 9:41" />Na woosi wu uva benu mbuungu a mamba ma unywa mu tooni ati, benu lili ba Masiya, mu mbuli me ndeele benu, nde a hunyambasana pfuta a nde ve.<verse eid="MRK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">A lidungasa tso mumosi mu bikenyi mo biniibi ve</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 18:6-9">Mty 18.6-9</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 17:1-2">Luk 17.1-2</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 9:42" />Ka tso muutu bwiisi mumosi mu bikenyi mo biniibi, bi bili mu usiila me imiinu, hubeedi bubwe huli nde ti bakutala nde manya bibaayaka laafulala bunene mu likiingu, na babwaha nde mu mubu. <verse eid="MRK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 9:43" />Tso hooho hwa we hu bibaayaka tooni ya mbwiili a we, kese hwo. Hubeedi bubwe huli we mu ukoto na hooho hu ikuunzu hu moonyi a mbuli, ka a mu uba na myoho myole na uyene hu mbeenge a mbaahu ve, hu mbaahu yi yaaveledima. <verse eid="MRK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 9:44" />[Huuna hu misobi myaavelekwa, na hu mbaahu yaaveledima<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.44 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Huuna hu misobi myaavelekwa, na hu mbaahu yaaveledima </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mabuuku makima, itsudu mo hiniihi hyo ve.</char></note>.] <verse eid="MRK 9:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 9:45" />Tso huulu hwa we hu bibaayaka tooni a mbwiili a we, kese hwo. Hubeedi bubwe huli we mu ukoto na tsode hu moonyi, ka a mu uba na miilu mya we myole ve na babwaha we hu mbeenge a mbaahu. <verse eid="MRK 9:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 9:46" />[Huuna hu misobi myaavelekwa, na hu mbaahu yaaveledima<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">9.46 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Huuna hu misobi myaavelekwa, na hu mbaahu yaaveledima </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mu mabuuku makima, itsudu mo hiniihi hyo ve.</char></note>.] <verse eid="MRK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 9:47" />Na tso diisu la we lili tooni a mbwiili a we, lobolo lo; hubeedi bubwe huli we mu ukoto hu Ipfumu hya Nzambi na diisu limosi, ka a mu uba na miisu ma we mamoole ve, na babwaha we hu mbeenge a mbaahu. <verse eid="MRK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 9:48" />Huuna hu “misobi myaavelekwa, na hu mbaahu yaaveledima<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.48 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 66:24">Esa 66.24</ref> </char></note>”. <verse eid="MRK 9:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 9:49" />Baatu boosi sa bavyohele hutso a mbaahu mapasi, na sa bayaka mungwa wu utsyemese bo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.49 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 2:13">Lev 2.13</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 9:50" />Mungwa ni isiha hi ibwe; ka tso mungwa diimbisi livu la nde, na ki isiha benu luufutala nde livu mo liina? Baani na mungwa mu benu mwakulu, na baani mu hyenze ŋa hati la benu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9.50 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 5:13">Mty 5.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 14:34">Luk 14.34</ref>; <ref loc="ROM 12:18">Lom 12.18</ref>; <ref loc="HEB 12:14">Heb 12.14</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 9:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="MRK 10" />
  <para style="s">Bafarisi bamiitehele Yisu mweto</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:1-12">Mty 19.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 16:18">Luk 16.18</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 10:1" />Yisu miimata ŋaana, na miiyene hu itaanzi hya Yude hi hili hu simu lina la Yolodani. Koonge a baatu yaabwekuukama ŋa pedu a nde; na nde akalongese bo we bu hwaba ipfu hya nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 19:1">Mty 19.1</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 10:2" />Kabu bibaayaka Bafarisi laayidi huli Yisu mu utehele nde mweto na baafuuli nde: «Baava muswa huli mulumi mu ubinga mukadi a nde?» <verse eid="MRK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 10:3" />Yisu akaali bo mu hyuhu: «Ki mukele Moose haaviidi benu?» <verse eid="MRK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 10:4" />Bo baaleeli ti: «Moose aviidi muswa mu usonehe muhanda a tsalili makweele, na wu ubinga mukadi a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 24:1">Pfu 24.1</ref>; <ref loc="JER 3:1">Yel 3.1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 5:31">Mty 5.31</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 10:5" />Buuna Yisu aleeli bo: «Ni mu tooni bunono bu mitima mya benu, Moose haasonihi tumili mo yiina. <verse eid="MRK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 10:6" />Ka ŋa mbandu a pangili a tsi, Nzambi “avaangi bo bahala na mukaasu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.6 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 1:27">Mba 1.27</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 19:4">Mty 19.4</ref> </char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 10:7" />“Ni mu buuna, bahala umata mu nzo a taata na ngu a nde na nde ukangama na mukadi a nde, <verse eid="MRK 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 10:8" />na bo a basaali boole ve, ka nyutu ndulu mosi.” <verse eid="MRK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 10:9" />Buuna, nyaha muutu aveletahula bi Nzambi haapfuuta.» <verse eid="MRK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 10:10" />Bu bo baayafutaha hu nzo, bayihi kaka baabwefuula Yisu mu musamu mo wuuna. <verse eid="MRK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 10:11" />Nde aviidi bo mvutu: «Pasi muutu wu ubinga mukadi a nde na ubwekwele mukima, miisa mayamba huli mukadi watsomi. <verse eid="MRK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 10:12" />Na tso mukaasu wu baakwele bingi mulumi a nde, na kweeli mukima, nde miisa mayamba.»<verse eid="MRK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miisyeme baana</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:13-15">Mty 19.13-15</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:15-17">Luk 18.15-17</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 10:13" />Baatu baabehili Yisu baana, mana nde abeembe bo<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.13 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mana nde abeembe bo </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peleve iliimbu hi ubeembe mu ubeeloso bo. </char></note>. Ka bayihi baasyembi bo.<verse eid="MRK 10:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 10:14" />Bu Yisu haamoni buuna, nde amoni lingebe na aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: «Nyahaani bibabana biya huli me, a likubasa bo ve; mu tooni ati, Ipfumu hya Nzambi hili hya ba baafwanina na bo. <verse eid="MRK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 10:15" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, woosi wu uveleyaka Ipfumu hya Nzambi we imwamwana, a huukoto huuna ve.» <verse eid="MRK 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 10:16" />Titswene nde avoli baana, abuumbi bo na asyemi bo mu usuusala bo myoho.<verse eid="MRK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Busina na Ipfumu hya Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 19:16-30">Mty 19.16-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:18-30">Luk 18.18-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 10:17" />Bu Yisu haakayene mu nzila, bahala limosi laayidi tiinu, laatsokimi ŋa busu bwa nde na laafuuli nde: «Mulongisi wu mubwe, hima me apfwana usa mu ubaha moonyi wu bilima na bilima?» <verse eid="MRK 10:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 10:18" />Yisu aleeli nde: «Mu hima we bibaayaka mu uteele me wu mubwe? A hu bibaayaka na muutu tso mumosi wu bibaayaka wu mubwe ve, vengo Nzambi siha. <verse eid="MRK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 10:19" />We yaabi Mikele: “A duba ve, a sa mayamba ve, a yiba ve, a ta imbangi hi upfuta mu muutu ve, a va muutu mbele ve, kiinza taata a we na ngu a we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:12-16">Pal 20.12-16</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:16-20">Pfu 5.16-20</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 24:14">Pfu 24.14</ref></char></note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 10:20" />Bahala laafutili nde: «Mulongisi, me atsingili matumili mo maana moosi umata bufudu bwa me.» <verse eid="MRK 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 10:21" />Yisu atali bahala, atondi lo na aleeli lo: «Isiha ndulu imosi hyamiivele we: yene, yasumbasa byosi bi we bibaayaka na byo na va mbongo a fwanda huli biyaha, na we ubaha busina hu yulu. Titswene yaanga, duukala me.» <verse eid="MRK 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 10:22" />Ka hu mbisa uyuha mambu mo maana, bahala laasulimini binama, na lo laayeni na lingebe, mu tooni ati, lo laaba na busina bu bulahi. <verse eid="MRK 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 10:23" />Yisu atala bayihi ba nde ba baaba baadiinga nde, nde aleeli bo: «Hu bibaayaka pasi mu bisina mu ukoto mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi!» <verse eid="MRK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 10:24" />Bayihi baamoni boomo bu baayuhi mambu mo maana. Ka Yisu abweleele bo: «Baana ba me, ki pila a pasi mu ukoto mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi! <verse eid="MRK 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 10:25" />Hwaleenge huli buuru nga irunga mu uvyoho ŋa vulu la tsongi, ka a huli isina mu ukoto mu Ipfumu hya Nzambi ve.» <verse eid="MRK 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 10:26" />Bayihi baabwesinzakimuha, na baakaleelesene: «A ka bunuubu, na utwala uyoboho?» <verse eid="MRK 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 10:27" />Yisu atali bo na aleeli: «Hubaakondosono huli baatu, ka a huli Nzambi ve, mu tooni ati, Nzambi ubaatwala moosi.» <verse eid="MRK 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 10:28" />Buuna, Peetelo aleeli nde: «A ka bisu! Bisu laamiisiisa byosi mu uduukala we.» <verse eid="MRK 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 10:29" />Yisu afutili nde: «Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, tso muutu siisi nzo a nde, baana ba ngu a nde, bakedi ba nde, ngu a nde, taata a nde, baana ba nde, buuve mangundu ma nde mu tooni a me na mu tooni a Musamu wu mubwe, <verse eid="MRK 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 10:30" />nde sa ayaka mu taangu mo yiniiyi kama-kama: mu manzo, baana ba ngu, bakedi, bangu, baana, mangundu, na mbingisili kaka. Na mu taangu yi yili mu uya, nde sa ayaka moonyi wu bilima na bilima. <verse eid="MRK 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 10:31" />Baatu ba balahi ba bali lolo yiniiyi batsomi, buuba baatu ba tsyelele, na baatu ba tsyelele, buuba baatu batsomi.»<verse eid="MRK 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu bibaayaka mu uyabisa yabisa bibaayaka mutatu lipfu na tsuuhili a nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:17-19">Mty 20.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:31-34">Luk 18.31-34</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 10:32" />Bo baaba mu nzila mu ukumasa hu Yeruselemi, na Yisu ateehili bayihi. Bayihi baaba na tsisu, na ba baakaduukala bo baaba na boomo. Yisu abwevolo bayihi bakuumi na boole na nde abaandihi uleele bo ma muuyiila nde mu mwana a taangu hoole. <verse eid="MRK 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 10:33" />«Yuhaani! Bisu a benu lika mu ukumasa hu Yeruselemi, hu buuyeholo Mwana a muutu huli bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na huli milongisi mi Mikele. Bo buubelese nde mu lipfu, na buuyeholo nde huli bakuutu ba bangoyi. <verse eid="MRK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 10:34" />Bangoyi buusyebe nde, buutuula nde maate, buufwiinza nde bikooti na buuduba nde. Hu mbisa bilumbu bitatu, nde usuuha mu babaakwa.»<verse eid="MRK 10:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pondili a Yaki na Yowani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:20-28">Mty 20.20-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 10:35" />Buuna, baana baboole ba Zebedayi, Yaki na Yowani, baayasusaha huli Yisu na baaleeli nde: «Mulongisi, bisu litondi ti we siila bisu bibaayaka bisu luuvondo we.» <verse eid="MRK 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 10:36" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Hima benu litoondi ti me tsiila benu?» <verse eid="MRK 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 10:37" />Bo baafutili nde: «Ŋa we uba hutso muyusu a we, va bisu hyese hi utsahala ŋa pedu a we, mumosi ŋa mbahala a we, mukima ŋa kaasu a we.» <verse eid="MRK 10:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 10:38" />Ka Yisu aleeli bo: «Benu a liyaabi hi benu lili mu uvondo ve! Benu luutwala unywa mbuungu mapasi yi me unywa, buuve uyaka tondihili yi me unzaka?» <verse eid="MRK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 10:39" />Bo baafutili nde: «Bisu luutwala.» Yisu aleeli bo: «Benu luunywa mbuungu yi me unywa, na benu luuyaka tondihili yi buutondehe me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.39 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ACT 12:2">Mav 12.2</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 10:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 10:40" />Ka mu bibaayaka litali wu utsahala ŋa mbahala a me, buuve ŋa kaasu a me, a me upa muswa ve. Mambuha mo maana mali ma bo baana ba baamiivangila mo.»<verse eid="MRK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 10:41" />Bu bayihi bakuumi bakima baayuhi maana, baanyongili Yaki na Yowani. <verse eid="MRK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 10:42" />Buuna, Yisu ateeli bo boosi na aleeli bo: «Benu liyaabi lo. Batumi ba matsi, bubaatuma baatu ba bo na matwala moosi. Na bapfumu bubaanangimana baatu. <verse eid="MRK 10:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 10:43" />Ka a hwafwana uba buuna ŋa hati la benu ve. Homo, muutu wu toondi uba mukuutu ŋa hati la benu, sa aba musalili a benu, <verse eid="MRK 10:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 10:44" />na muutu wu toondi uba watsomi ŋa hati la benu, sa aba muviha a boosi. <verse eid="MRK 10:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 10:45" />Mu tooni ati, Mwana a muutu a haaya mana basalila nde ve, ka mu usalila baatu na uva muvumu a nde we kodi mu uyobolo ba balahi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.45 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 13:14">Yow 13.14</ref>; <ref loc="PHP 2:7">Flp 2.7</ref>; <ref loc="EPH 1:7">Efe 1.7</ref>; <ref loc="COL 1:4">Kol 1.4</ref>; <ref loc="1TI 2:6">1Ti 2.6</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 2:14">Tit 2.14</ref> </char></note>.»<verse eid="MRK 10:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibeeloso inzimana Baritime</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 20:29-34">Mty 20.29-34</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 18:35-43">Luk 18.35-43</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 10:46" />Yisu na bayihi ba nde baatoodi hu musyenge a Yeriko. Na bu Yisu haapali mu Yeriko, na bayihi ba nde na koonge a baatu, inzimana imosi nga nduhi a Baritime, mwana a Time, aba atsahala ŋa muvanga a nzila na akasa musohi. <verse eid="MRK 10:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 10:47" />Bu nde haayuhi ti aba Yisu musi Nazareti, nde abaandihi ufulaha: «Yisu, Mwana a Davidi, kwila me lingebe!» <verse eid="MRK 10:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 10:48" />Baatu ba balahi baakapfubasa nde mana nde aba swii. Ka nde arangili ufulaha: «Mwana a Davidi, kwila me lingebe!» <verse eid="MRK 10:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 10:49" />Yisu atsikimi na aleeli: «Teelaani me nde.» Bo baateeli inzimana, na uleele nde: «Hwada, teleme, nde bibaayaka mu uteele we!» <verse eid="MRK 10:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 10:50" />Buuna, inzimana hyabumi iyunga hya hyo, hyatelimi mu mawasa, na hyayidi huli Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 10:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 10:51" />Yisu afuuli nde: «Hima we tondi ti me tsiila we?» Inzimana hyafutili: «Rabuni<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">10.51 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Rabuni</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbindulili ti: Mulongisi.</char></note>, me tondi ubwemono!» <verse eid="MRK 10:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 10:52" />Na Yisu aleeli nde: «Yene, imiinu hya we himiifuuhasa we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10.52 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 9:22">Mty 9.22</ref> </char></note>.» Na masulubete, nde abwemono na abaandihi uduukala Yisu mu nzila.<verse eid="MRK 10:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="MRK 11" />
  <para style="s">Kotili a Yisu hu Yeruselemi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:1-11">Mty 21.1-11</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:28-40">Luk 19.28-40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:12-19">Yow 12.12-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 11:1" />Bu bo baaba bebele na musyenge a Yeruselemi, bebele na mala ma Betefaze na ma Betanya, bo baatoodi hu tsyelo isyelo hi miti mya Olive<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:1">Mty 21.1</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:29">Luk 19.29</ref> </char></note>. Yisu atsindihi boole mu bayihi ba nde na aleeli bo: <verse eid="MRK 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 11:2" />«Yenaani hu bula bu buli hu busu bwa benu. Bu benu luukoto mu bwo, benu luumono mwana ibubuuru<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.2 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mwana ibubuuru </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Ibulu hi Yisu haanami ŋa yulu a hyo mu ukoto hu Yeruselemi.</char></note> baakutalala, hi muutu tso mumosi kini a hatsahili ŋa yulu a hyo ve. Nyangulaani hyo na behelaani me hyo. <verse eid="MRK 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 11:3" />Tso muutu fuuli benu: “Mu hima benu lili mu uvaanga buuna?” Leelaani nde: “Pfumu bibaayaka na nzala a hyo, ka nde ubwefutala benu hyo ŋaniiŋa, mawasa mo maniima.”» <verse eid="MRK 11:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 11:4" />Bo baayeni na baamoni mwana ibubuuru ŋa mbadi, ŋa lisaandi, baakutalala bebele na idibuhu hi munywa a nzo. Bo baanyaanguli hyo. <verse eid="MRK 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 11:5" />Mwana a baatu bakima ba baaba ŋaana, baafuuli bo: «Benu hima lili mu usa? Mu hima benu lili mu unyaangula mwana ibubuuru mo hiniihi?» <verse eid="MRK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 11:6" />Bo baakaali we bu Yisu haaleeli bo. Na baasiingisi bo mu uyene. <verse eid="MRK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 11:7" />Bo baabitili Yisu mwana ibubuuru. Bo baasuusili biyunga bya bo ŋa yulu a hyo. Na Yisu atsahili ŋa yulu a hyo<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 9:9">Zak 9.9</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 11:8" />Baatu ba balahi baayali biyunga bya bo mu nzila, bakima baasuusi mu nzila mangemvu ma bo baakesi mutso matsyehe<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="2KI 9:13">2Pf 9.13</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 11:9" />Ba baakayene busu na ba baakaduukala Yisu, baakafulaha: «Osana<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">11.9 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Osana </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbindulili ti: «Muyusu huli Nzambi» mu ndaha ya bisu Arameyene.</char></note>! Nyaha Nzambi asyeme, wu bibaayaka mu uya mu nduhi a Pfumu! <verse eid="MRK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 11:10" />Nyaha Nzambi asyeme Ipfumu hi hili mu uya, Ipfumu hya Davidi, taata a bisu! Osana hu hati mayulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:25-26">Mkg 118.25-26</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 21:9">Mty 21.9</ref></char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 11:11" />Na Yisu akoti hu Yeruselemi mu nzo a Nzambi. Bu nde haamani utala byosi bi byaba byadiinga nde, nde ayeni hu Betanya na bayihi bakuumi na boole, mu tooni ati, taangu aba yaaka lala.<verse eid="MRK 11:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mufiinge wu avele bafiinge</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18-22">Mty 21.18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 11:12" />Mu ilumbu hi hyaduukili, mu taangu yi bo baakamata Betanya, nzala yaafwengi Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 11:13" />Nde atalili mufiinge wu aba na makaya, nde ayatala tso nde akiibaha miluunda. Ka bu nde haayato ŋa pedu mufiinge, nde a haabiisi isiha ve, ndulu makaya, mu tooni ati, yiina a yaaba kuuhu bafiinge ve. <verse eid="MRK 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 11:14" />Buuna, Yisu aleeli huli mufiinge: «Nyaha pasi muutu abweveledya miluunda mya we!» Na bayihi ba nde baayuhi ma nde haaleeli.<verse eid="MRK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miibinga banga mumbungu mu nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:12-17">Mty 21.12-17</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:45-48">Luk 19.45-48</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 2:13-22">Yow 2.13-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 11:15" />Bo baatoodi hu Yeruselemi. Yisu akoti mu nzo a Nzambi na abaandihi ubinga ba baakasuumbasa na ba baakasuumba mu nzo a Nzambi. Nde atakuli bametse ma basanzi ba mbongo na bitsiha bi basuumbisi ba mabembe. <verse eid="MRK 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 11:16" />Na nde a haakanyaha muutu tso mumosi mu ukesese na pasi isiha mu nzo a Nzambi ve. <verse eid="MRK 11:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 11:17" />Nde akalongese na akaleele bo: «Mabasonehe ma Ngidi mali mu uleele: “Nzo a me sa bateele yo nzo lisambulu yi mabuli moosi”. Ka benu laamiikitusa yo murali a biibi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.17 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 21:13">Mty 21.13</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 19:46">Luk 19.46</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 8:29">1Pf 8.29</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 56:7">Esa 56.7</ref>; <ref loc="JER 7:11">Yel 7.11</ref> </char></note>!» <verse eid="MRK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 11:18" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na milongisi mi Mikele, baayuhi ma maavyohi, na bo baakasaha buni bo buuduba Yisu. Eye, bo baaba na boomo bwa nde, mu tooni ati, koonge a baatu yoosi yaakimuhi mu ndongisili a nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 11:19" />Bu tsitsaha yaatoodi, Yisu na bayihi ba nde baapali mu musyenge.<verse eid="MRK 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mufiinge wu akanya: Imiinu na lisambulu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:18-22">Mty 21.18-22</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 11:20" />Ilumbu hi hyaduukili ŋa ngwali, bu bo baakavyoho, bayihi baamoni mufiinge amiikanya natee mu manganzi. <verse eid="MRK 11:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 11:21" />Bu Peetelo haayibuhili moonyi mu ma maavyohi, aleeli Yisu: «Rabi, mono mufiinge wu we asinga, miikanya woosi.» <verse eid="MRK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 11:22" />Yisu aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: «Baani na imiinu mu Nzambi! <verse eid="MRK 11:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 11:23" />Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu: Tso muutu leeli huli isyelo mo hiniihi: “Mata ŋaana na yene yabwa mu mubu”, hwavele usa paha mu mutima a nde, ka siidi imiinu ti bibaayaka nde aleeli luutswiha, buuba buuna mu nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 11:24" />Ni mu buuna, me ndeele benu lo: Byosi bi benu luuvondo mu lisambulu, saani hiitu ti benu laamiiyaka byo, na Nzambi uva benu byo. <verse eid="MRK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 11:25" />Ŋa benu libaateleme mu usambila, tso benu lili na tooni na muutu, saani nde kolo-kolo, mana Taata a benu wu bibaayaka hu mayulu asa benu kaka kolo-kolo mu mabi ma benu. <verse eid="MRK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 11:26" />[Ka tso benu a lisiidi bana kolo-kolo ve, Taata a benu wu bibaayaka hu mayulu a huusa benu kaka kolo-kolo mu mabi ma benu ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">11.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:15">Mty 6.15</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 18:35">18.35</ref> </char></note>.»]<verse eid="MRK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Matwala ma Yisu huni mali mu umata?</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:23-27">Mty 21.23-27</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:1-8">Luk 20.1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 11:27" />Bo baabwefutaha hu musyenge a Yeruselemi. Bu Yisu haakayene na uya mu nzo a Nzambi, bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na milongisi mi Mikele na mikukunyungu baayamono nde. <verse eid="MRK 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 11:28" />Bo baafuuli nde: «Mu ki matwala we ubaasa mavaanga mo maniima? Na ava we lituma bibaayaka uvaanga mo?» <verse eid="MRK 11:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 11:29" />Yisu akaali bo: «Me upa benu hyuhu ndulu imosi; futalaani me mvutu, mana me ndeele benu mu ki lituma me ndi mu utsa mavaanga mo maniima. <verse eid="MRK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 11:30" />Tondihili a Yowani hu yulu yaamata vo huli baatu? Vaani me mvutu.» <verse eid="MRK 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 11:31" />Bo baakakaakana ŋa hati la bo: «Tso bisu a benu likaali ti: “hu yulu yaamata”, nde ufuula bisu a benu: “Mu hima benu laavelisiila Yowani imiinu?” <verse eid="MRK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 11:32" />Ka bisu a benu utwala uleele: “Huli baatu laamata”?» Bo baaba na boomo bwa koonge a baatu, mu tooni ati, boosi baakatsima ti Yowani ni mumbihuli wa mbuli. <verse eid="MRK 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 11:33" />Buuna, bo baafutili huli Yisu: «Bisu a liyaabi ve.» Yisu akaali bo: «Me kaka a undeele benu mu ki lituma me ndi mu utsa mavaanga mo maniima ve.»<verse eid="MRK 11:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="MRK 12" />
  <para style="s1">Kuma huli banga mangundu ma miti mya vinye</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 21:33-46">Mty 21.33-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:9-19">Luk 20.9-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 12:1" />Yisu abaandihi uyambila na bo mu makuma: «Bahala limosi laakuni ngundu yi miti mya vinye. Nde adiingi yo muumbu, nde avahi ipinyili hya mbutu a vinye, na atuungi nzo yi mutaabu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 5:1-2">Esa 5.1-2</ref></char></note> mu bakeedi. Titswene nde asiisi ngundu huli basali ba mangundu ma vinye, na nde ayeni hu mudyenge. <verse eid="MRK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 12:2" />Bu taangu yaatoodi, nde atsindihi musalili mumosi huli basali ba mangundu ma vinye, mu uyavolo la nde kabu la mbutu yi miti mya vinye. <verse eid="MRK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 12:3" />Ka bo baakaangi musalili, baabeeti nde na baafutili nde myoho bunyanga. <verse eid="MRK 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 12:4" />Buuna, nde abwetsindaha bo musalili mukima. Wuuna, bo baateti nde mu mutswe na baatuhi nde. <verse eid="MRK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 12:5" />Nde abwetsindaha mukima, na wuuna, bo baadubi. Titswene na bakima ba balahi ba bo baavangili bumosi: Bo baabeeti bamosi na baadubi bakima. <verse eid="MRK 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 12:6" />Hwasaali na nde ndulu mwana a nde mumosi wu litondo. Nde atsindihi bo nde hu tsyelele na utsima ti: “Bo sa bakiinza mwana a me.” <verse eid="MRK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 12:7" />Ka basali ba mangundu ma vinye, baaleelisini: “Nde wunuwu ni mubyalili mukobe! Yaani, lidubaani nde, na mukobe sa aba wa bisu a benu!” <verse eid="MRK 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 12:8" />Bo baakaangi nde, baadubi nde na baabumi nde hu mbadi a ngundu miti mya vinye.<verse eid="MRK 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 12:9" />Nga ngundu miti mya vinye hima huusa? Nde sa aya aduba basali ba mangundu ma vinye, na nde sa ava ngundu huli bakima. <verse eid="MRK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 12:10" />Benu a laamaataanga dyambu mo liniili mu Mabasonehe ma Ngidi ve?</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">“Manya bibaayaka batuungi baabumi,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:10">laaka manya la talu bibaayaka itungu.<verse eid="MRK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 12:11" />Pfumu ni wu asa buuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:11">na lo ni dyambu bibaayaka muyusu ŋa miisu ma bisu!”»<verse eid="MRK 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 12:12" />Bapfumu mo baana, baakasaha nzila yi ukaanga Yisu, ka bo baamoni boomo bwa koonge. Bo baakatsima ti, mu tooni a bo Yisu hatiidi kuma mo yiina. Bo baasiisi nde na baayeni.<verse eid="MRK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Limandu la Kayifa</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:15-22">Mty 22.15-22</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:20-26">Luk 20.20-26</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 12:13" />Bo baatsindihi huli Yisu mwa litangu bibaayaka Bafarisi na mwana a baatu ba kabu la Eloode, mu uyayebe nde mu mikuma mi nde huupalisa. <verse eid="MRK 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 12:14" />Bu bo baayidi, bo baleeli nde: «Mulongisi, bisu liyaabi ti we nga imbuli; we a hali na boomo bwa muutu tso mumosi ve, na we a hali mu utala baatu mu umono hwa miisu ve. Ka we bibaayaka mu ulongese nzila a Nzambi mu imbuli hyoosi. Baava muswa mu ufuta limandu huli Kayisaali? Hwafwana huli bisu mu ufuta vo naana?» <verse eid="MRK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 12:15" />Bu Yisu haaba haayaaba muwala a bo, nde aleeli bo: «Mu hima benu lili mu utehele me mweto? Behelaani me denye mumosi me mono nde.» <verse eid="MRK 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 12:16" />Bo baabehili nde denye, na Yisu afuuli bo: «Hiinzi na bisono mo biniibi bya na?» Bo baafutili ti bya Kayisaali. <verse eid="MRK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 12:17" />Buuna, Yisu aleeli bo: «A ka! Futalaani huli Kayisaali bya Kayisaali, na huli Nzambi bya Nzambi.» Na bo baakimuhi mu tooni a mvutu a nde.<verse eid="MRK 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Hyuhu mu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:23-33">Mty 22.23-33</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27-40">Luk 20.27-40</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 12:18" />Basaduki ba bali mu usilasa ti a yili ve, baayamono Yisu na baafuuli nde: <verse eid="MRK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 12:19" />«Mulongisi, mono ma Moose haasonihi mu bisu: “Tso bahala likwiidi na lisiisi mukadi hwavele a mwana, mwana a ngu a nde sa akweele mukwili mo wuuna mana nde apalisa imbisa huli wu miikwa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 25:5">Pfu 25.5</ref>,<ref loc="DEU 25:6">6</ref> </char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 12:20" />Kaahu hwaba na baana ba ngu tsambu ba babahala. Watsomi akweeli mukaasu na akwiidi hwavele usiisa imbisa. <verse eid="MRK 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 12:21" />Waboole akweeli mukwili mo wuuna, na akwiidi hwavele usiisa imbisa. Ni bumosi kaka mu wu mutatu, <verse eid="MRK 12:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 12:22" />na tso mumosi mu batsambu a hali wu asiisi imbisa ve. Ŋa mbisa a bo boosi, mukaasu kaka akwiidi. <verse eid="MRK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 12:23" />Mu ilumbu hya tsuuhili a babaakwa, ŋa babaakwa buusuuha, mukadi mo wuuna wa na huuba? Mu tooni ati bo batsambu baakweeli nde!» <verse eid="MRK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 12:24" />Yisu akaali bo: «Benu laamiidunga. Benu liyaabi mu hima? Mu tooni ati benu a lili mu utsikaha tso Mabasonehe ma Ngidi, tso matwala ma Nzambi ve. <verse eid="MRK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 12:25" />Ni mu buuna, ŋa babaakwa buusuuha, babahala na bakaasu a buubwekweelesene ve, ka bo buuba we bapofi hu mayulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 22:30">Mty 22.30</ref>; <ref loc="1JN 3:2">1Yo 3.2</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 12:26" />Mu mamatali babaakwa ba buusuuha, benu a laataanga mu libuuku la Moose, ma Nzambi haaleeli nde ŋa pedu a saangi ve: “Me ni Nzambi a Abrahami, Nzambi a Isaki na Nzambi a Yakobi!” <verse eid="MRK 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 12:27" />Nzambi, husiitisi Yisu, a hali Nzambi a babaakwa ve, ka nde Nzambi a ba bali moonyi. Benu laamiisinzadunga.»<verse eid="MRK 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukele wu afulala bunene</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:34-40">Mty 22.34-40</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 10:25-28">Luk 10.25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 12:28" />Mumosi mu milongisi mi Mikele wu ayuhi bo mu usobosono minwya, na wu amoni ti Yisu afutili bo mvutu yimbwe, ayafuula Yisu: «Ki Mukele bibaayaka watsomi mu Mikele myosi?» <verse eid="MRK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 12:29" />Yisu afutili nde: «Watsomi ni wunuwu: “Yuha, Isereli! Pfumu Nzambi a bisu, bibaayaka ndulu Pfumu nde siha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.29 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4">Pfu 6.4</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 12:30" />We afwana utondo Pfumu Nzambi a we mu mutima a we woosi, mu muvumu a we woosi, mu buyedi bwa we bwosi, na mu mufudi a we woosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:4-5">Pfu 6.4-5</ref></char></note>.” <verse eid="MRK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 12:31" />Wa myole ni wunuwu: “We afwana utondo muna a we, we we mwakulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.31 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note>.” A hu bibaayaka na Mukele mukima wu afulala mya myole miniimi bunene ve.» <verse eid="MRK 12:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 12:32" />Mulongisi mikele aleeli nde: «Buuna ni bubwe, mulongisi! Ma we miileele ni ma mbuli: Nzambi ndulu nde siha bibaayaka, na a hu bibaayaka na Nzambi mukima ve ŋa yulu a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.32 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 4:35">Pfu 4.35</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 12:33" />Na ti utondo nde mu mutima a we woosi, mu buyedi bwa we bwosi, na mu mufudi a we woosi, na utondo muna a we, we we mwakulu, hwafulala tsoongo na bungodu bwosi bwa tsuhili banyama<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 6:6">Ose 6.6</ref></char></note> buuve uva nde bungodu bukima.» <verse eid="MRK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 12:34" />Bu Yisu haamoni ti nde akaali bu hwafwana, aleeli nde: «We a hali lala na Ipfumu hya Nzambi ve.» Na muutu tso mumosi a haabwebila nde byuhu uva ve.<verse eid="MRK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kristo na Davidi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 22:41-46">Mty 22.41-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:41-44">Luk 20.41-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 12:35" />Bu Yisu haakalongese mu nzo a Nzambi, nde aviidi hyuhu mo hiniihi: «Buni milongisi mi Mikele myutwala uleele ti Masiya mwana Davidi ali? <verse eid="MRK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 12:36" />Davidi nde mwakulu hutso Livupu la Ngidi aleeli:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">“Pfumu miileele huli Pfumu a me:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">Tsahala ŋa mbahala a me,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="MRK 12:36">natee bu me utsuusa baboho ba we hu tsina a miilu mya we<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="1CO 15:25">1Ko 15.25</ref> </char></note>.”<verse eid="MRK 12:36" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 12:37" />Davidi nde mwakulu bibaayaka mu uteele nde “Pfumu”: ka nde buni huuba mwana a nde?»</para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 12:37">Koonge a baatu ba balahi, yaakayuha Yisu na kinya yoosi.<verse eid="MRK 12:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miisyembe milongisi mi Mikele</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 23:1-36">Mty 23.1-36</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:45-47">Luk 20.45-47</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 12:38" />Mu ndongisili a nde, nde akaleele bo: «Kebaani na milongisi mi Mikele. Bo baatondo ubaadyengele na miroopo mi mila, na ubaatondo ti babwehe bo mu matandala ma mikungi. <verse eid="MRK 12:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 12:39" />Bo ubaasoolo bitsiha bya busu mu manzo ma masambulu ma Bayudaayo, na mambuha ma muyusu mu mikungi mya byudya. <verse eid="MRK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 12:40" />Bo ni ubaataana manzo ma bakwili, na mu usaha umonehele, bo bali mu usa masambulu ma mala. Bo sa bayaka tsundusu yi yaafulala bunono<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.40 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 23:14">Mty 23.14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 20:27">Luk 20.27</ref>; <ref loc="TIT 1:11">Tit 1.11</ref> </char></note>!»<verse eid="MRK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bungodu bu mukwili wu iyaha</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="LUK 21:1-4">Luk 21.1-4</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 12:41" />Bu Yisu haaba haatsahala mu nzo a Nzambi ŋa busu bu itunga hi bungodu, nde akamono buni koonge a baatu yaakabwaha mbongo. Bisina bi bilahi byakasuusa mbongo yindahi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12.41 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 21:1">Luk 21.1</ref>; <ref loc="2KI 12:9">2Pf 12.9</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 12:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 12:42" />Mukwili wu iyaha mumosi kaka ayidi, na asuusi mwa bimbombongo byole, bya talu ya hoole. <verse eid="MRK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 12:43" />Buuna Yisu ateeli bayihi ba nde na aleeli bo: «Mu mbuli me ndi mu undeele benu, mukwili mo wunuuwu wu iyaha, miisuusa hu hwafulala boosi ba bali mu usuusa mutso itunga. <verse eid="MRK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 12:44" />Mu tooni ati, bana boosi baviidi bongo yi yaabwevele na tsoongo huli bo; ka nde, hutso buyaha bwa nde, viidi byosi bi nde abeedi na byo, byosi bi nde akiisalila mu idiingu hya nde.»<verse eid="MRK 12:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="MRK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu bibaayaka mu uyabisa utsala hwa nzo a Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:1-2">Mty 24.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:5-6">Luk 21.5-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 13:1" />Bitsiitsa na Yisu mu upala mu nzo a Nzambi, mumosi mu bayihi ba nde aleeli nde: «Mulongisi, mono! Ki pila bubwe bu mamanya, ki pila bunene bwa nzo!» <verse eid="MRK 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 13:2" />Yisu afutili nde: «We bibaayaka mu umono bunene bwa nzo mo yiniiyi? A huusaala ŋaniiŋa tso manya ŋa yulu a manya ve; byosi sa batsala.»<verse eid="MRK 13:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mapasi na mbingisili</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:3-14">Mty 24.3-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:7-19">Luk 21.7-19</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 13:3" />Yisu atsahili hu yulu isyelo hi miti mya Olive, masungimini na nzo a Nzambi. Peetelo, Yaki, Yowani na Andele baafuuli nde ŋa muvanga: <verse eid="MRK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 13:4" />«Leele bisu ki taangu maana muutswiha, na ki iliimbu hyuyabisa ti maana moosi muusuka.»<verse eid="MRK 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 13:5" />Buuna, Yisu abaandihi uyabisa bo: «Kebaani, muutu a hadungasa benu. <verse eid="MRK 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 13:6" />Ba balahi buuya mu nduhi a me na buuleele: “Ni me!” Na bo buudungasa baatu ba balahi. <verse eid="MRK 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 13:7" />Ŋa benu luuyuha mu utoyo mu midiingu, na batsyetsye ba midiingu, a liba na boomo ve. Maana maafwana uvangama. A yiumaaba tsukusu ve. <verse eid="MRK 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 13:8" />Tsi mosi sa yitelemene tsi yina, na ipfumu sa hitelemene ipfumu hina. Toto sa yinyingama mu mambuha ma pila mu pila, napa limbunga sa liba. Yiina yiuba ni mbandihili misoongo mya mbutili. <verse eid="MRK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 13:9" />Kebaani mu tooni a benu mwakulu. Ka sa bayeholo benu mu manzo ma tsundusu; sa babeete benu mu manzo ma masambulu ma Bayudaayo. Sa batsundasa benu ŋa busu bu batumi ba matsi na ŋa busu bu bapfumu mu tooni a me; hiina hyuba imbangi huli bo. <verse eid="MRK 13:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 13:10" />Ka hwafwana ti bamaayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe huli mabuli moosi. <verse eid="MRK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 13:11" />Ŋa buubita benu hu nzo a tsundusu, a laamaateehele umono boomo mu ma benu luuleele. Ka leelaani mambu ma buuva benu mu ngunga mo yiina, mu tooni ati, mo a muumata huli benu ve, ka ni huli Livupu la Ngidi. <verse eid="MRK 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 13:12" />Mwana a ngu sa ayeholo mwana a ngu a nde mwakulu hu lipfu, na taata sa avaanga bumosi mu mwana a nde. Baana sa batelemene babuti ba bo, na buutuma ubelese bo mu lipfu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EZK 38:21">Ezk 38.21</ref>; <ref loc="MIC 7:6">Mik 7.6</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 13:13" />Baatu boosi sa babelele benu mu tooni a nduhi a me. Ka woosi wu ukuunda natee hu tsukusu, nde wuuna sa afuuha.<verse eid="MRK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mapasi ma likini a laamoni ve</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:15-28">Mty 24.15-28</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:20-24">Luk 21.20-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 13:14" />Ŋa benu luumono wu bali mu uteele “musafuli wu mutsali” ateleme ŋa mbuha yi nde haavelefwana uba<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 9:27">Dan 9.27</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 11:31">11.31</ref>; <ref loc="DAN 12:11">12.11</ref></char></note>, nyaha wu bibaayaka mu utaanga atsikaha mo bubwe! Buuna, ba buuba hu Yude, nyaha babata bebele na bisyelo; <verse eid="MRK 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 13:15" />woosi wu uba hu yulu ibaanga hya nzo a nde, avelesutaha mu uvolo isiha mutso a nzo; <verse eid="MRK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 13:16" />na woosi wu uba hutso a ngundu a nde, avelefutaha hu nzo mu uvolo iyunga hya nde. <verse eid="MRK 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 13:17" />Ki pila lingebe luuba mu bakaasu banga mayimi na mu ba buukaanwyasa baana mabeelo mu bilumbu mo biina! <verse eid="MRK 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 13:18" />Baasambilaani mana mambu mo maana a mayiila mu taangu a piyu yi mifudi! <verse eid="MRK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 13:19" />Mu tooni ati, mu bilumbu mo biina, sa huba na mapasi ma maafulala bunene na moosi ma laamiibwaana na mo, umata pangili a tsi, ŋa Nzambi haavaangi byosi, natee lolo yiniiyi. Mapasi ma pila mo yiina, a muubweba ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 12:1">Dan 12.1</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 13:20" />Tso Pfumu a haavoli kesili yi ukuka bilumbu ve, muutu tso mumosi a haakiifuuha ve. Ka nde haakuki bilumbu, mu tooni a ba nde haamiisoolo. <verse eid="MRK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 13:21" />Ni mu buuna, tso muutu leeli benu: “Monwaani, Masiya ndyowu ŋaniiŋa!” Buuve ti: “Monwaani, ndyowunuuwu!” A lisiila nde imiinu ve. <verse eid="MRK 13:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 13:22" />Mu tooni ati, bakristo ba mapfuta na mimbihuli mi mapfuta buuteleme; bo sa bavaanga biliimbu bya kimuhili na bimangu mu udungasa tso huyelimini, ba Nzambi haamiisoolo. <verse eid="MRK 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 13:23" />Buuna benu, kebaani! Me amiinzibusa benu mu moosi.<verse eid="MRK 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nziili a Mwana a muutu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:29-31">Mty 24.29-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:25-28">Luk 21.25-28</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 13:24" />Ka mu bilumbu mo biina, hu mbisa mapasi ma pila mo yiina, taangu sa yikituha piipidi, tsuungi a huubweva mweede ve, <verse eid="MRK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 13:25" />bamvwelele buubwa umata hu mayulu, na matwala ma mali hu mayulu muunyingama<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.24-25 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 13:10">Esa 13.10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 34:4">34.4</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 32:7-8">Ezk 32.7-8</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 2:10">Yoe 2.10</ref>; <ref loc="JOL 3:4">3.4</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 13:26" />Buuna, sa bamono Mwana a muutu mu uya hutso mayidu, mu matwala ma nde moosi na muyusu a nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DAN 7:13">Dan 7.13</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 13:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 13:27" />Buuna, nde sa atsindaha bapofi mu ukuukaha ba nde haamiisoolo mu bituungu bibina bya tsi, umata tsoso a toto natee tsoso mayulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">13.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 30:4">Pfu 30.4</ref>; <ref loc="NEH 1:9">Neh 1.9</ref>; <ref loc="ZEC 2:10">Zak 2.10</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ileso hi mufiinge</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:32-35">Mty 24.32-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 21:29-33">Luk 21.29-33</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 13:28" />Tsikahaani ndongisili a kuma yi mufiinge. Bu bitabi bya nde bimiikolo, na bu makaya ma nde mamiifula, benu limiiyaaba ti kwanga yaaka bebele. <verse eid="MRK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 13:29" />Ni bumosi benu kaka, ŋa benu luumono misamu mo miniimi mu utswiiha, yaabaani ti Mwana a muutu aka bebele, ŋa munywa a nzo a benu. <verse eid="MRK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 13:30" />Mu mbuli, me ndi mu undeele benu: tuungi mo liniili a luuvyoho ve, tswamina maana moosi maya. <verse eid="MRK 13:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 13:31" />Yulu na toto byuvyoho, ka mambu ma me a muuvyoho ve.<verse eid="MRK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nzambi siha yaabi taangu a tsukusu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 24:36-44">Mty 24.36-44</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 13:32" />Mu ma mali mu utala ilumbu buuve ngunga yi mambu mo maana muuya, pasi muutu a hayaabi ve, a tso bapofi hu yulu ve, a tso Mwana kaka ve; ka ndulu Taata siha yaabi lo. <verse eid="MRK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 13:33" />Kebaani! Baani likanda, mu tooni ati, benu a liyaabi ŋa taangu yiuya ve. <verse eid="MRK 13:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 13:34" />Sa buba we ŋa muutu ubaayene mudyenge: nde bibaayaka mu usiisa nzo a nde na ubaava lituma la nzo huli basalili ba nde; muutu muutu na isalu hya nde, na bibaayaka mu utuma keedi a munywa a nzo mu uba likanda. <verse eid="MRK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 13:35" />Buuna, baani likanda, ka benu a liyaabi ŋa pfumu a nzo huuya ve: ŋa tsitsaha, buuve hu hahati la busi, buuve ŋa tsusu huukohele, buuve ŋa ngwali. <verse eid="MRK 13:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 13:36" />Ka tso nde yafutaha masulubete hu iliba, a hwafwana ve ti nde abiisa benu tolo. <verse eid="MRK 13:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 13:37" />Ma me ndi mu undeele benu maniima, me ndi mu undeele mo huli boosi. Baani likanda!»<verse eid="MRK 13:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="MRK 14" />
  <para style="s1">Pfuundu yimbi mu tooni a Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:1-5">Mty 26.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:1-2">Luk 22.1-2</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 11:45-53">Yow 11.45-53</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 14:1" />Bilumbu byole byaba byamiisaala mu uto mu mukungi a Paake na wu mapa ma maaveledaana<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 12:1-27">Pal 12.1-27</ref> </char></note>. Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na milongisi mi Mikele baakasaha nzila yi ukaanga Yisu mu dyeele na uduba nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 14:2" />Ni mu buuna, bo baakaleele: «A luusaani buuna mu taangu mukungi ve, kini baatu buusa tudu.»<verse eid="MRK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mukaasu miipuupala Yisu nyafi ŋa yulu mutswe</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:6-13">Mty 26.6-13</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 12:1-8">Yow 12.1-8</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 14:3" />Yisu aba hu musyenge a Betanya, hu nzo a Simoni nga bwatsi. Bu nde haaba haatsahala ŋa metse, mukaasu mumosi akoti na itutu hya alabatere<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">alabatere</char><char style="ft" closed="false">Itutu hibaavaanga mu manya bibaayaka lifuuka.</char></note> hi hyaluula mu nyafi ya mu nare<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.3 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">nare </char><char style="ft" closed="false">maadi ma tsulu yimbwembwe ma bubaakamuna mu makaya. Ni mu maadi mo maana bubaavaanga nyafi.</char></note> ya mbuli ya talu yindahi. Mukaasu adibuli itutu na apuupili nyafi ŋa yulu mutswe a Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 14:4" />Bamosi ŋa hati la ba baaba ŋaana, baanyongi: «Ki tooni mu ubiiyasa nyafi mo yiniiyi? <verse eid="MRK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 14:5" />Bakiisuumbasa yo mu talu yi yaafulala makama matatu ma badenye na uva mbongo mo yiina huli bapuumbu!» Bo baakapamina mukaasu mo wunuwu hu unono. <verse eid="MRK 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 14:6" />Ka Yisu aleeli: «Nyahaani nde. Mu hima benu lili mu ukwamisa nde? Ma nde amiivangila me, maafulala bubwe. <verse eid="MRK 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 14:7" />Mu tooni ati, benu luuba na bapuumbu taangu yoosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.7 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 15:11">Pfu 15.11</ref></char></note>, na pasi taangu yi benu litoondi, benu utwala uvangila bo libwe; ka uto ti me, benu a luuba na me taangu yoosi ve. <verse eid="MRK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 14:8" />Nde miivaanga bibaayaka nde atwali uvaanga: nde miiteehele upuupala nyutu a me nyafi, mu uvangimasa yo mu tooni a ndiihili a me. <verse eid="MRK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 14:9" />Mu mbuli me ndeele benu: pasi tsyelo yi buukaayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe, mu toto yoosi, buukaayambila mu mukaasu mo wunuwu na buukaayibwala moonyi mu ma nde amiivaanga.»<verse eid="MRK 14:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yuda li mu usaha buni nde huuyeholo Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:14-16">Mty 26.14-16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:3-6">Luk 22.3-6</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 14:10" />Yuda Isikaryoti, mumosi mu bakuumi na boole bibaayaka bayihi, ayamono bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi mu uyeholo bo Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 14:11" />Bu baayuhi dyambu mo liina, bo baamoni kinya na baasiidi nde lahi bibaayaka uva nde mbongo. Umata buuna, Yuda akasaha buni nde huuyeholo bo Yisu mu taangu yi yaafwana.<verse eid="MRK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bayihi ba Yisu bali mu uvangimasa ilaambu hya Paake</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:17-19">Mty 26.17-19</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:7-13">Luk 22.7-13</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 14:12" />Ilumbu hyatsomi hi mukungi wu mapa ma maaveledaana, ilumbu hi baakayeholo mameme mu tooni a Paake, bayihi ba Yisu baafuuli nde: «Huni we toondi ti bisu liyavangimasa we ilaambu hi we udya mu Paake?» <verse eid="MRK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 14:13" />Buuna, Yisu miitsindaha bayihi ba nde boole na uleele bo: «Yenaani hu musyenge, muutu mumosi uyaabwana benu, akaanga lisanga bibaayaka laaluula mu mamba. Duukalaani nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 14:14" />Na hu nde huukoto, leelaani huli nga nzo: “Mulongisi miituma bisu mu uleele we: Itini hya nzo hi me undya ilaambu hya Paake na bayihi ba me huni hili?” <verse eid="MRK 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 14:15" />Nde umweese benu hu yulu ibaanga hya nzo, itini hya nzo imosi hiinene, hi baamiivangimasa nzyeni na byosi bi buusalila. Ni muuna benu luusa pangimini a bisu a benu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 14:16" />Bayihi baayeni na baatoodi hu musyenge. Bo baabiisi moosi we bu Yisu haaleeli bo. Na bo baavangimisi ilaambu hya Paake.<verse eid="MRK 14:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu bibaayaka mu udya ilaambu hya Paake na bayihi ba nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:20-30">Mty 26.20-30</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:14-23">Luk 22.14-23</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:21-26">Yow 13.21-26</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23-25">1Ko 11.23-25</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 14:17" />Bu tsitsaha yaatoodi, Yisu ayidi na bayihi bakuumi na boole. <verse eid="MRK 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 14:18" />Bu bo baabeedi ŋa metse na bu bo baakadya, Yisu aleeli: «Mu mbuli me ndeele benu: mumosi mu benu wu bibaayaka mu udya na me sa ayeholo me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.18 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:10">Mkg 41.10</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:17">Mav 1.17</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 14:19" />Bayihi baabahi lingebe, na bo baabaandihi ufuula nde mumosi mumosi: «Ni me?» <verse eid="MRK 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 14:20" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Ni mumosi mu benu, mumosi mu bakuumi na boole, nde wuuna wu bibaayaka mu upfuuta myoho mu ikoombe na me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 41:10">Mkg 41.10</ref></char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 14:21" />Eye, Mwana a muutu mu ukwa ali, we bu Mabasonehe mali mu uyabisa<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.21 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 22:2-19">Mkg 22.2-19</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 53">Esa 53</ref></char></note>. Ka ki pila a tsingiili huli wu bibaayaka mu uyeholo Mwana a muutu! Beedi kini bubwe mu muutu mo wuuna, avelebutama hwa nde.»<verse eid="MRK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 14:22" />Bu bo baaba mu udya, Yisu avoli lipa na, hu mbisa ufutala matondo huli Nzambi, nde atabuli lo, akabi lo na aviidi lo huli bayihi ba nde na aleeli: «Volwaani, yiniiyi ni nyutu a me<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.22 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:26">Mty 26.26</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:19">Luk 22.19</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 11:23">1Ko 11.23</ref> </char></note>.» <verse eid="MRK 14:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 14:23" />Titswene, nde avoli mbuungu, hu mbisa ufutala matondo huli Nzambi, nde aviidi bo yo, na bo baanywidi bo boosi. <verse eid="MRK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 14:24" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Maniima ni makila ma me, makila ma Nzuhisini yi Nyatihi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Pal 24.8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Yel 31.31-34</ref> </char></note>, ma maatsamuhi mu tooni a baatu ba balahi. <verse eid="MRK 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 14:25" />Mu mbuli me ndeele benu: Me a umbwenywa vinye ve, natee ilumbu hi me unywa yo yi nyatihi, hutso Ipfumu hya Nzambi.» <verse eid="MRK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 14:26" />Titswene, bo baayimbi mikuunga mi mukungi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.26 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 26:30">Mty 26.30</ref></char></note>, bo baayeni hu isyelo hi miti mya Olive.<verse eid="MRK 14:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu bibaayaka mu uyabisa ti Peetelo utuna nde</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:31-35">Mty 26.31-35</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:31-34">Luk 22.31-34</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 13:36-38">Yow 13.36-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 14:27" />Yisu aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: «Benu boosi sa litiimba me, mu tooni ati, baasonehe: “Me utete keedi mameme, na mameme muutsaamuha<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 13:7">Zak 13.7</ref></char></note>”. <verse eid="MRK 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 14:28" />Ka me utsuuha mu babaakwa, me uteehele benu hu Ngalili.» <verse eid="MRK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 14:29" />Peetelo aleeli nde: «Tso bana boosi batiimbi we, me, me a utiimba we ve!» <verse eid="MRK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 14:30" />Yisu akaali nde: «Mu mbuli me ndeele we: lolo yiniiyi, ndulu butsuhu mo bunuubu, tswamina tsusu akohele kohele yoole, we, we utuna me tunala tatu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 14:31" />Ka Peetelo akasinzaleele: «Tso hili ti me kwa itwadi na we, ubila ve, me utwala utuna we ve!» Na bayihi bana boosi baakaleele bumosi.<verse eid="MRK 14:31" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu miiyasambila hu Ngetesemani</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:36-46">Mty 26.36-46</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:39-46">Luk 22.39-46</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 14:32" />Titswene, bo baabweto ŋa mbuha mosi yi bubaateele Ngetesemani, na Yisu aleeli huli bayihi ba nde: «Tsahalaani ŋaniiŋa, mu taangu yi me unzatsambila.» <verse eid="MRK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 14:33" />Nde abiti itwadi na nde Peetelo, Yaki na Yowani. Yisu abaandihi ukimuha na umono mangoongo, <verse eid="MRK 14:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 14:34" />na nde aleeli bo: «Muvumu a me amiiluula mu lingebe natee huukwa; tsahalaani ŋaniiŋa, na baani likanda!» <verse eid="MRK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 14:35" />Nde asusihi hoole hu lala; abwidi ŋa toto na akasambila mana, tso huyelimini, ngunga mapasi yiniiyi, yitahuha lala na nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 14:36" />Nde akaleele: «Aba, Taata<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">14.36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Aba </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbindulili mu ndaha ba Arameyene ti: Taata, buuve, o taata a me.</char></note>: we ubaatwala moosi; tahusa mbuungu mapasi mo yiniiyi lala na me. Ka, a bu me miitoodo ve, bu we miitondo.» <verse eid="MRK 14:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 14:37" />Nde ayafutaha huli bayihi ba nde na ayabiisa bo tolo. Yisu aleeli huli Peetelo: «Simoni, we aka tolo? We a haabaha mifudi mi uba likanda tso mu ngunga mosi ve? <verse eid="MRK 14:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 14:38" />Baani likanda na sambilaani, mana benu a libwa mu malobese. Iluunzi hili hi hyahwada, ka imuutu hili hi hyakolo.»<verse eid="MRK 14:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 14:39" />Nde abwetahuha na asambili mu ubaafutahala mambu ni mo mamosi. <verse eid="MRK 14:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 14:40" />Titswene, nde abweyafutaha huli bayihi, na abiisi bo boosi baabwaamina; Miisu ma bo abeedi maaleme. Na bo a baabahi dyambu bibaayaka ukaala nde ve. <verse eid="MRK 14:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 14:41" />Ŋa nde haayafutaha futaha bibaayaka matatu, Yisu aleeli bo: «Benu likini tolo, benu uvuuma lili mu uvuuma? Limiifwa! Ngunga yimiito. Bunuubu, Mwana a muutu bamiiyeholo ŋa myoho mya banga masumu. <verse eid="MRK 14:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 14:42" />Telemaani, tswendaani! Monwaani muutu wu uyeholo me aka bebele!»<verse eid="MRK 14:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu bamiikaanga</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:47-56">Mty 26.47-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:47-53">Luk 22.47-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:3-12">Yow 18.3-12</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 14:43" />Bu Yisu haaba kini mu utoyo, Yuda, mumosi mu bakuumi na boole bibaayaka bayihi ayidi. Ŋa mbisa a nde, hwaba na koonge balwani na basabila mu myoho, na bimbondi. Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na milongisi mi Mikele na mikukunyungu, ni ba baatsindihi bo. <verse eid="MRK 14:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 14:44" />Yuda, wu akayeholo Yisu, amweesi bo iliimbu hi huusalila: «Wuuna wu me umbuumba, wuuna ni nde; kaangaani nde na bitaani nde hutso a keelisili yimbwe.» <verse eid="MRK 14:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 14:45" />Bu Yuda haayidi, nde ayasusaha huli Yisu na aleeli nde: «Rabi!» Na nde abuumbi nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 14:46" />Buuna bakima baabwiili na baakaangi nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 14:47" />Ka mumosi mu ba baabeedi ŋaana, aduti sabila a nde, ateti musalili a mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, na akesi nde tswi. <verse eid="MRK 14:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="MRK 14:48" />Yisu aleeli bo: «Me kaahu mudubi me ndi, bu benu luuya na basabila na bimbondi mu uyakaanga me? <verse eid="MRK 14:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="MRK 14:49" />Bilumbu byosi, me mbeedi ŋa hati la benu na me kambaandongese mu nzo a Nzambi, benu a laakaangi me ve. Ka maana mali mu uyiila, mana Mabasonehe ma Ngidi matswiiha.» <verse eid="MRK 14:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="MRK 14:50" />Na bayihi boosi baatiimbi nde na baabati. <verse eid="MRK 14:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="MRK 14:51" />Mupfudu-mbahala mumosi akaduukala Yisu. Nde aba alwata ndulu lileeso la mu lino. Baayehili ukaanga nde, <verse eid="MRK 14:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="MRK 14:52" />ka nde anyahula lileeso, nde abati pene yi imbutala-ngu.<verse eid="MRK 14:52" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu ŋa busu bwa pfuundu lituma bibaayaka bangaanga ba Nzambi</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:57-68">Mty 26.57-68</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-55">Luk 22.54-55</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:63-71">22.63-71</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:13-14">Yow 18.13-14</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:19-24">18.19-24</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="MRK 14:53" />Bo baabiti Yisu huli mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi, hu hwakuukimi bangaanga ba Nzambi boosi, mikukunyungu na milongisi mi Mikele. <verse eid="MRK 14:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="MRK 14:54" />Peetelo akaduukala Yisu hu lala, natee hu hati litandala la nzo a mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi. Nde atsahili na bakeedi na nde akayoto mbaahu.<verse eid="MRK 14:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="MRK 14:55" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na pfuundu lituma yoosi, baakasaha imbangi hi hyumweese tooni yi uduba Yisu. Ka bo a baabahi ve. <verse eid="MRK 14:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="MRK 14:56" />Mu tooni ati, baatu ba balahi baakava bimbangi bi mapfuta mu nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.56 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 27:12">Mkg 27.12</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 35:11">35.11</ref></char></note>, ka byo byakatungasana byo mwakulu. <verse eid="MRK 14:56" /><verse number="57" style="v" sid="MRK 14:57" />Mwana a baatu bakima baatelimi na baaviidi imbangi hi mapfuta hiniihi mu nde: <verse eid="MRK 14:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="MRK 14:58" />«Bisu laayuha nde mu uleele ti: “Me utsala nzo a Nzambi mo yiniiyi yi baatuunga mu myoho mya baatu, na mu bilumbu bitatu, me utuunga kima yi yiuveleba vaanga la myoho mya baatu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.58 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 2:19-21">Yow 2.19-21</ref> </char></note>.”» <verse eid="MRK 14:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="MRK 14:59" />Ka tso mu mukuma mo wuuna, bo baakatungasana. <verse eid="MRK 14:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="MRK 14:60" />Buuna, mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi atelimi ŋa kuungi, na afuuli Yisu: «We a hali mu ukaala pasi lo ve? Lima we leeli, mu bimbangi bi baatu bali mu uta mu we biniibi?» <verse eid="MRK 14:60" /><verse number="61" style="v" sid="MRK 14:61" />Ka Yisu abeedi swii, nde a haafutili dyambu ve. Mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi abwefuula nde: «We ni Masiya, Mwana a wu baasyeme<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.61 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:7">Esa 53.7</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 8:32">Mav 8.32</ref> </char></note>?» <verse eid="MRK 14:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="MRK 14:62" />Yisu akaali: «Eye, ni me! Na benu luumono Mwana a muutu atsahala ŋa mbahala a Pungu Matwala na uya hutso mayidu ma yulu.» <verse eid="MRK 14:62" /><verse number="63" style="v" sid="MRK 14:63" />Buuna mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi akasuli bikutu bya nde mwakulu na aleeli: «Bisu a lisaali na nzala bambangi ve! <verse eid="MRK 14:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="MRK 14:64" />Benu limiiyuha nde mu utuha Nzambi! Benu buni litsimi?» Boosi baakabelese nde, na baakaleele ti lipfu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.64 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 24:16">Lev 24.16</ref> </char></note> laahwama na nde. <verse eid="MRK 14:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="MRK 14:65" />Titswene, mwana a baatu bakima baabaandihi utuula nde maate. Bo baapfubihi nde hiinzi, baateti nde makome na ubaaleele: «Sa bumbihuli, dihula na miitete we!» Bakeedi baavoli Yisu na baateti nde mapali<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">14.65 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JOB 16:10">Yob 16.10</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 50:6">Esa 50.6</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:3">Yow 19.3</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 14:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Peetelo miituna Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 26:69-75">Mty 26.69-75</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 22:54-62">Luk 22.54-62</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:15-18">Yow 18.15-18</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:25-27">18.25-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="MRK 14:66" />Peetelo aba kini hu tsina hu litandala, ŋa musalili wu mukaasu mumosi wu mukuutu bangaanga ba Nzambi haayidi. <verse eid="MRK 14:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="MRK 14:67" />Nde miimono Peetelo mu uyoto mbaahu, nde miidihula nde, na miileele nde: «We kaka, we beedi na Yisu musi Nazareti.» <verse eid="MRK 14:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="MRK 14:68" />Peetelo atuni na aleeli: «Me a hanzaabi bibaayaka we bibaayaka mu ukana uleele ve, me a handi mu utsikaha ve.» Titswene, nde amati ŋa mukoho a mbaahu, mu uyene hu mbadi. [Buuna tsusu akohili.] <verse eid="MRK 14:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="MRK 14:69" />Ka musalili wu mukaasu amoni nde na abwefutahala uleele ŋa busu bwa ba baabeedi ŋaana: «Bahala mo liniili mumosi mu bo ali!» <verse eid="MRK 14:69" /><verse number="70" style="v" sid="MRK 14:70" />Na Peetelo abwetuna. Mwana a taangu hoole, ba baabeedi ŋaana baabweleele huli Peetelo: «Ni mbuli, we bibaayaka mumosi mu baatu mo baana, mu tooni ati, we kaka musi Ngalili.» <verse eid="MRK 14:70" /><verse number="71" style="v" sid="MRK 14:71" />Buuna Peetelo abaandihi ufulaha: «Nyaha Nzambi asyembe me tso me ndi mu upfuta! Mu mbuli a Nzambi, me a hanzaabi muutu wu benu lili mu uyambila mu nde ve.» <verse eid="MRK 14:71" /><verse number="72" style="v" sid="MRK 14:72" />Masulubete, tsusu akohili kohele la moole, na Peetelo ayibuhili moonyi mu mambu ma Yisu haaleeli nde: «Tswamina tsusu akohele kohele yoole, we utuna me tunala tatu.» Mu tsimi mo yiina, Peetelo abaandihi ulila.<verse eid="MRK 14:72" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="MRK 15" />
  <para style="s1">Yisu ŋa busu bwa Pilaato</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:1-2">Mty 27.1-2</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 27:11-14">11-14</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:1-5">Luk 23.1-5</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:28-38">Yow 18.28-38</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 15:1" />Masulubete ŋa ngwali, bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi, na mikukunyungu, na milongisi mi Mikele, na pfuundu banzonzi yi Bayudaayo yoosi, basiidi pfuundu. Bo baatumisi uhada Yisu, baabehi nde na baayehuli nde huli Pilaato. <verse eid="MRK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 15:2" />Pilaato afuuli Yisu: «Be we ni pfumu Bayudaayo?» Yisu afutili: «We miileele lo.» <verse eid="MRK 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 15:3" />Bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi baakesi nde mu matooni ma malahi. <verse eid="MRK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 15:4" />Pilaato abwefuula nde: «We a hafutili isiha ve? We bibaayaka mu uyuha matooni moosi ma bali mu ukese we!» <verse eid="MRK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 15:5" />Ka Yisu a haabwefutala mvutu tso mosi ve. Ni mu buuna, Pilaato haakimuhi.<verse eid="MRK 15:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Yisu bamiibelese mu lipfu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:15-31">Mty 27.15-31</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:13-25">Luk 23.13-25</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 18:39">Yow 18.39</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 18:40">40</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1-16">19.1-16</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 15:6" />Mu pasi mukungi a Paake, Pilaato akanyahula ikondaayi imosi, hi koonge yaakavondo. <verse eid="MRK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 15:7" />Kaahu, bahala limosi nga nduhi Barabasi, aba hutso a kondaayi, itwadi na banga mikungu ba baadubi muutu mu mudiingu a tudu. <verse eid="MRK 15:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 15:8" />Koonge a baatu yaakumisi huli Pilaato, na yaavondi ti nde avaanga dyambu mu bo, we bu hu bibaayaka ipfu hya nde. <verse eid="MRK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 15:9" />Pilaato afutili bo: «Benu litoondi ti me nyahula benu pfumu Bayudaayo?» <verse eid="MRK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 15:10" />Mu tooni ati, nde aba ayaaba ti, bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi mu nyengi baayehuli nde Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 15:11" />Ka bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi baatuumbisi koonge a baatu, mana Pilaato anyahula bo mu mawasa Barabasi. <verse eid="MRK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 15:12" />Pilaato abwefuula bo: «Ka tso me nyahuli benu Barabasi, hima benu litoondi ti me tsa mu wu benu lili mu uteele pfumu Bayudaayo?» <verse eid="MRK 15:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 15:13" />Bo baafutili nde mu ubaafulaha: «Komene nde!» <verse eid="MRK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 15:14" />Pilaato afuuli bo: «Ki dyambu lilibi nde haavaanga?» Na bo baabwesinzafulaha mu mifudi: «Komene nde!» <verse eid="MRK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 15:15" />Pilaato atoondi umweese koonge a baatu kinya, na nde anyahuli bo Barabasi. Titswene, nde atumisi ti bafwinza Yisu bikooti, na ayehuli nde mana bakomene nde ŋa muti<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.15 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 27:26">Mty 27.26</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:1">Yow 19.1</ref> </char></note>.<verse eid="MRK 15:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Masadaadu mali mu ukwede Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:27-31">Mty 27.27-31</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:2-3">Yow 19.2-3</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 15:16" />Masadaadu maabiti Yisu hu nzo mutumi, na bo baateeli koonge masadaadu yoosi. <verse eid="MRK 15:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 15:17" />Bo baalwatisi nde libita bibaayaka libeenge, na ŋa mutswe a nde, baasuusili mutata wu baavaangi mu ibata hi matsyende. <verse eid="MRK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 15:18" />Titswene, bo baabaandihi ubila nde na ubaaleele: «Bwehe pfumu Bayudaayo!» <verse eid="MRK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 15:19" />Bo baakatete nde litsootso mu mutswe, baakatuula nde maate na baakatsokomo ŋa busu bwa nde mu ukongemene nde. <verse eid="MRK 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 15:20" />Ŋa baamani usinzakwede nde, bo baamaasi nde libita bibaayaka libeenge na baabwelwatisa nde bikutu bya nde.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 15:20">Yisu bamiikomene ŋa muti</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 15:20">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:32-44">Mty 27.32-44</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:26-43">Luk 23.26-43</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:17-27">Yow 19.17-27</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 15:20">Bo baabiti nde hu mbadi mu uyakomene nde. <verse eid="MRK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="MRK 15:21" />Muutu mumosi wu akamata hu matsyehe nga nduhi Simoni musi Kilene, taata a Alezande na wa Rufusi, avyohili ŋaana. Masadaadu maakwiihi nde kuruwa a Yisu mu ubita. <verse eid="MRK 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="MRK 15:22" />Bo baabiti Yisu hu mbuha mosi yi bubaateele Ngolongota, mbindulili ni ti: «Mbuha yi Ibanga.» <verse eid="MRK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="MRK 15:23" />Bo baakiiva nde malamu ma baapfuuta na myre<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.23 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">malamu ma baapfuuta na myre </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Malamu ma baapfuuta na biloongo, ma baakanywiisa boosi ba baakakomene ŋa kuruwa, mana balaangisa bo mu uvelemono pasi mu taangu yi buukomene bo.</char></note>, ka Yisu abisi unywa. <verse eid="MRK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="MRK 15:24" />Titswene, bo baakomini nde ŋa kuruwa na baakabisini bikutu bya nde bi baatiidi ngodo, mu uyaaba kabu la pasi muutu. <verse eid="MRK 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="MRK 15:25" />Aba aka ngunga yi ipfwa ya ŋa ngwali, ŋa bo baakomini nde ŋa kuruwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="MRK 15:26" />Mabaasonihi mu umweese tooni yi ubelese nde aba ni maniima: «Pfumu Bayudaayo.» <verse eid="MRK 15:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="MRK 15:27" />Baakomini Yisu na biibi byole, mumosi ŋa mbahala a nde, mukima ŋa kaasu. <verse eid="MRK 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="MRK 15:28" />[Buuna ni bu hwavangimi, Mabasonehe ma Ngidi: «Baasuusi nde mu litaangu bibaayaka badubi.»] <verse eid="MRK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="MRK 15:29" />Bapyohi nzila baakatuha nde na baakanyingasa mitswe mya bo, na ubaaleele: «E! We wu bibaayaka mu utsala nzo a Nzambi na utuunga yo mu bilumbu bitatu, <verse eid="MRK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="MRK 15:30" />yoboho we mwakulu, sutaha ŋa kuruwa!» <verse eid="MRK 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="MRK 15:31" />Ni bumosi kaka, bakuutu ba bangaanga ba Nzambi na milongisi mi Mikele baakakwede Yisu na baakaleelesene: «Nde afuuhasa bakima, ka nde utwala ufuuhasa nde mwakulu ve! <verse eid="MRK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="MRK 15:32" />Nyaha Kristo, pfumu Isereli, asutaha taangu yiniiyi ŋa kuruwa! Tso bisu limoni nde mu usutaha, buuna bisu luusa imiinu mu nde.» Ba baakomini itwadi na Yisu, baakatuha kaka nde.<verse eid="MRK 15:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lipfu la Yisu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:45-56">Mty 27.45-56</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:44-49">Luk 23.44-49</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:28-30">Yow 19.28-30</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="MRK 15:33" />Mu ngunga ya mwangulu, piipidi yabwiidi mu toto yoosi natee mu ngunga yi matatu ya hu mbisa a mwangulu. <verse eid="MRK 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="MRK 15:34" />Na mu ngunga yi matatu ya hu mbisa a mwangulu, Yisu afulihi mu ndaha yi mifudi: «Eloyi, Eloyi, lema sabakatani?» Mbindulili ni ti: «Nzambi a me, Nzambi a me, tooni ma we miisiisa me siha<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.34 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Eloyi, Eloyi, lema sabakatani? </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mbindulili ni ti: Nzambi a me, Nzambi a me, tooni ma we miisiisa me siha? </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 22:2">Mkg 22.2</ref></char>.</note>?» <verse eid="MRK 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="MRK 15:35" />Mwana a baatu bakima ba baabeedi ŋaana, baayuhi nde na baakaleele: «Yuhaani, nde aka mu uteele Eliya!» <verse eid="MRK 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="MRK 15:36" />Mumosi mu bo ayabwadiha ikamuni imosi mu vinye a nganyi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">15.36 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">vinye a nganyi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Peleve malamu ma biyaha buuve ma masadaadu. </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PSA 69:22">Mkg 69.22</ref></char>.</note>, na akatisi hyo mu litsootso, titswene nde aviidi Yisu mu unywa na aleeli: «Keelaani, limonwaani tso Eliya uyaasutasa nde ŋa kuruwa!» <verse eid="MRK 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="MRK 15:37" />Ka Yisu afulihi mu ndaha yi mifudi, na nde amani muvumu.<verse eid="MRK 15:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="MRK 15:38" />Nguumbu yi yaaba mu nzo a Nzambi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">15.38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 26:31-33">Pal 26.31-33</ref>; <ref loc="2CO 3:14">2Ko 3.14</ref></char></note> yaakasuhi mu bibadi byole, umata hu yulu natee hu tsina. <verse eid="MRK 15:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="MRK 15:39" />Mukuutu a kama bibaayaka masadaadu wu aba mu masungimini ma Yisu, amono buni Yisu haamani muvumu, aleeli: «Bahala mo liniili mbuli beedi Mwana a Nzambi!» <verse eid="MRK 15:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="MRK 15:40" />Hwaba na mwa bakaasu ba baakatala hu lala. Ŋa hati la bo, Mariya musi Magadala, Mariya ngu a Yaki wu ikenyi na wa Yose, na Salome. <verse eid="MRK 15:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="MRK 15:41" />Bo baakaduukala Yisu na baakakumbasa nde ŋa nde haaba hu Ngalili. Bakaasu bakima kaka ba balahi baaba ŋaana, ba baakakumasa na Yisu hu Yeruselemi.<verse eid="MRK 15:41" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Kotisili a Yisu mu ngila</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 27:57-61">Mty 27.57-61</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 23:50-56">Luk 23.50-56</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 19:38-42">Yow 19.38-42</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="MRK 15:42" />Tsitsaha aba yaamiito, ka bu hyaaba ilumbu hya pangimini, teehele ilumbu hya Saba, <verse eid="MRK 15:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="MRK 15:43" />Yosefi, musi Arimate, inama hi likiinzu hya pfuundu yinene, wu akakeele nziili Ipfumu hya Nzambi nde kaka, ayidi. Nde ayeni na ibahala mu uyavondo nyutu a Yisu huli Pilaato. <verse eid="MRK 15:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="MRK 15:44" />Pilaato akimuhi mu uyuha ti Yisu aba amiikwa. Nde ateeli mukuutu a kama bibaayaka masadaadu, na afuuli nde tso Yisu aba amiidiinga na ukwa. <verse eid="MRK 15:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="MRK 15:45" />Bu mukuutu a kama bibaayaka masadaadu haabehili nde tsaangu, Pilaato asiingisi Yosefi mu uvolo nyutu a Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 15:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="MRK 15:46" />Yosefi asuumbi lileeso la lino, asutisi nyutu a Yisu ŋa kuruwa, apoti yo mu lileeso, na ayasuusa yo hutso a ngila yibaavaha hutso a manya. Titswene, nde atsindihili manya bibaayaka linene mu udibuha ikotili hya ngila. <verse eid="MRK 15:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="MRK 15:47" />Mariya musi Magadala na Mariya ngu a Yose, baakatsikaha mbuha yi baasuusi Yisu.<verse eid="MRK 15:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="MRK 16" />
  <para style="s1">Tsuuhili a Yisu mu babaakwa bamiiyabisa huli bakaasu</para>
  <para style="r">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:1-8">Mty 28.1-8</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:1-12">Luk 24.1-12</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:1-10">Yow 20.1-10</ref></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="MRK 16:1" />Bu ilumbu hya Saba hyaavyohi, Mariya musi Magadala, na Mariya ngu a Yaki, na Salome, baasuumbi maadi ma tsulu mu uyapuupala mu nyutu a Yisu. <verse eid="MRK 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="MRK 16:2" />Mu limiingu ŋa hati a ngwali, ŋa nyangu ubaapala, bo baayeni hu ngila. <verse eid="MRK 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="MRK 16:3" />Bo baakaleelesene: «Na utsindahala bisu a benu manya la ŋa kotili a ngila?» <verse eid="MRK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="MRK 16:4" />Ka bu bo baasiimbuli miisu, bo baamoni ti manya bibaayaka laaba laafulala bunene, aba baamiikwatsindahala. <verse eid="MRK 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="MRK 16:5" />Buuna, bo baakoti hutso a ngila; bo baamoni muuna, mufudu mbahala mumosi, atsahala ŋa mbahala, alwata muroopo wu mufuuka, na bo baamoni busisu. <verse eid="MRK 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="MRK 16:6" />Ka nde aleeli bo: «A liba na busisu ve! Benu Yisu musi Nazareti, wu baakomini lili mu usaha; nde miisuuha. Nde a hali ŋaniiŋa ve. Monwaani mbuha yi baasuusi nde. <verse eid="MRK 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="MRK 16:7" />Ka yenaani yaleelaani huli bayihi ba nde na huli Peetelo ti: “Nde miitswamina benu hu Ngalili. Ni huuna benu luumono nde, we bu nde haaleeli benu lo”.» <verse eid="MRK 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="MRK 16:8" />Buuna bo baapali mu ngila na baabati na likamba mu boomo. Bo a baayabisi musamu huli pasi muutu ve, mu tooni ati, bo baaba na boomo.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="MRK 16:8">Bimonihili bya Yisu wu miisuuha mu babaakwa</para>
  <para style="r" vid="MRK 16:8">
    <ref loc="MAT 28:9-10">Mty 28.9-10</ref>,<ref loc="MAT 28:18-20">18-20</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 24:13-53">Luk 24.13-53</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:11-23">Yow 20.11-23</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 1:6-11">Mav 1.6-11</ref></para>
  <para style="p" vid="MRK 16:8">[<verse eid="MRK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="MRK 16:9" />Hu mbisa a tsuuhili a nde ŋa ngwali yi ilumbu hi limiingu, Yisu ateehili umonehele huli Mariya musi Magadala, wu nde haabingisi matengo tsambu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="JHN 20:14">Yow 20.14</ref>,<ref loc="JHN 20:16">16</ref>; <ref loc="LUK 8:2">Luk 8.2</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="MRK 16:10" />Nde ayayabisa huli ba baabeedi na Yisu. Bo baaba mu bukwili na baakalila. <verse eid="MRK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="MRK 16:11" />Ka bu bo baayuhi mukaasu mu uleele ti Yisu moonyi ali, na ti nde miimono nde, bo a baasiidi mukaasu imiinu ve.<verse eid="MRK 16:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="MRK 16:12" />Titswene, Yisu amonihili mu ifwaani ikima huli bayihi boole, ba baaba mu nzila mu uyene hu bula bumosi<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.12 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:13">Luk 24.13</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="MRK 16:13" />Bo baayafutaha mu uyabisa huli bayihi bana, ka a baasiidi imiinu mu bo kaka ve.<verse eid="MRK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="MRK 16:14" />Hu tsyelele, Yisu amonihili huli bayihi bakuumi na mumosi, mu taangu yi baaba ŋa meetse. Nde asyembi bo na mifudi mu pelili a bo imiinu na mu bunono bu mitima mya bo, mu tooni ati, bo a baasiidi imiinu huli ba baayabisi bo ti Yisu moonyi ali ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">16.14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 24:36">Luk 24.36</ref>; <ref loc="JHN 20:19">Yow 20.19</ref>; <ref loc="1CO 15:5">1Ko 15.5</ref> </char></note>. <verse eid="MRK 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="MRK 16:15" />Titswene, nde aleeli bo: «Yenaani mu tsi yoosi, mu uyayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe huli bivaangu bya Nzambi byosi. <verse eid="MRK 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="MRK 16:16" />Pasi muutu wu usa imiinu na wu buutondehe, sa ayoboho. Ka muutu wu uvelesa imiinu sa babelese. <verse eid="MRK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="MRK 16:17" />Monwaani biliimbu bya kimuhili bi byukaaba na ba buusa imiinu: mu nduhi a me, bo buubingasa matengo, bo buuyambila mandaha ma manyatihi; <verse eid="MRK 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="MRK 16:18" />bo buukaanga bataadi, na tso bo banywidi isiha hi hyutwala ubita bo hu lipfu, hyo a hyumweese bo pasi ve. Bo buusuusala babeedu myoho, na babeedu buubeeloho.»<verse eid="MRK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="MRK 16:19" />Hu mbisa uleele bo buuna, Pfumu Yisu baabiti hu yulu, na atsahili ŋa mbahala a Nzambi. <verse eid="MRK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="MRK 16:20" />Na bayihi baayeni mu uyayabisa Musamu wu Mubwe matsyelo moosi. Pfumu akasala na bo, na akasilasa imbuli hya mambu ma bo baakayabisa, mu biliimbu bya kimuhili bi bo baakasa.]<verse eid="MRK 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="MRK 16" />
</usx>